\\n\\nIf no nominee is announced by November 3, 2026, 11:59PM ET, this market will resolve to \\\"Other\\\".\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be a consensus of official Democrat sources, including https://democrats.org/.\\n\\nAny replacement of the nominee before election day will not change the resolution of the market.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-nicholas-sciretta-be-the-democratic-nominee-for-ny-04\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-23T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xd83ef2d66b68877ea06b54b6760fd29df3df936a5cfe5ddaff6a5dbc562a5f00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x860159e32432d5a5dde8ddea24026280465f42b86322d905db7659b531ccab72\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/who-will-be-the-democratic-nominee-for-ny-12-sL9s2x0LnsR1.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/who-will-be-the-democratic-nominee-for-ny-12-sL9s2x0LnsR1.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"41480954438913063970197792021573332585554410838284506333996743209224990064024\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.115,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"70963008880021254228771190647726911759536509259304029983946935833811359615992\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.885,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\",\"primary elections\",\"Democratic Primary\",\"House Primary\",\"New York Primary\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-10-09T23:29:27Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0xa5d79e71e66c9fe122f8b8b3ca6ab7a0e3048bd8508f130746944e92ed79ddf3\",\"question_id\":\"0x0b6235b08df5cb142c191a770c6fd31e97facff05fb7f56c572a435bf73b7c05\",\"question\":\"Will Xavier Becerra win the California Governor Election in 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to according to the candidate who wins the 2026 California gubernatorial election currently scheduled for November 3, 2026.\\n\\nIf the results of the election are not confirmed by July 31, 2027, this market will resolve to \\\"Other\\\".\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the Associated Press, Fox News, and NBC. This market will resolve once all three sources call the race for the same candidate. If all three sources haven’t called the race in this state for the same candidate, this market will resolve based on official certification.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-xavier-becerra-win-the-california-governor-election-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-11-03T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x0b6235b08df5cb142c191a770c6fd31e97facff05fb7f56c572a435bf73b7c00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0xd429983b30df05c1565027815755005a729c5a3b9ac6daa952b3d962820a32b5\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-xavier-becerra-win-the-california-governor-election-in-2026-a_BhzW4kyJfq.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-xavier-becerra-win-the-california-governor-election-in-2026-a_BhzW4kyJfq.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":166}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"60977129292396881848833910361112107174416489010090570432106122538120602786646\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.4385,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"42544248033910169115455586624331983477679665735561815306855702312176773945155\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.5615,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"US Election\",\"California Midterm\",\"Governor midterms\",\"Rewards 300 4.5 50\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-19T23:53:41Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x3a4346b0618af3efcd946f27650d20cee348308bd4f8c06e62df8e9eabbe0fdb\",\"question_id\":\"0xe5cc0a68573afba7c3f37c9a29765d6fa02fe04efd3ec92dfd3ca0ab17d91fa1\",\"question\":\"Will Ivanka Trump announce a presidential run before 2027?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to “Yes” if the listed individual announces that they are running for President in the 2028 United States presidential election by December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nAn announcement by the listed individual  will be sufficient to trigger a \\\"Yes\\\" resolution, regardless of whether they actually filed a nomination to run, or whether they actually file a nomination to run in the future.\\n\\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be official statements by the listed individual (ex: via speech, social media, etc.), however a consensus of credible reporting may also be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-ivanka-trump-announce-a-presidential-run-before-2027\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/ivanka+trump.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/ivanka+trump.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"39437292826767693760422550980817174078437966735695178411252552844889624222280\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.0735,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"70702358899020234295974411191493283331885371886687749484133365656723585927454\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.9265,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Celebrities\",\"President\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-10T23:57:06Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x7466eca8dfce78de354c2a526c3c4317615fdf14846135c93909815ebe26d066\",\"question_id\":\"0x4789db0978520585bf6db241baea334874963c7deef184d49fa331090873a401\",\"question\":\"Will Waymo operate in 6 cities on June 30 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the number of distinct cities in which Waymo’s ride-hailing service is publicly available, either through the Waymo One app or a partner platform such as Uber, as of June 30, 2026 at 11:59 PM ET.\\n\\nA city counts if riders can book a Waymo vehicle through either the Waymo One app or the Uber app at that time. Any taxi service provided by Waymo that is available to the general public and operates without a human driver actively controlling the vehicle will count, regardless of membership or other financial restrictions.\\n\\nLimited pilot programs, internal employee testing, or invite-only service will not qualify.\\n\\nIf Waymo describes a broader region (e.g., “Los Angeles County” or “San Francisco Bay Area”) as a single service area, it will count as one city/region for this market.\\n\\nThe primary resolution source is official information from Waymo (see: https://waymo.com/rides/), however a consensus of credible reporting may also be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-waymo-operate-in-6-cities-on-june-30-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-30T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\"