ual  will be sufficient to trigger a \\\"Yes\\\" resolution, regardless of whether they actually filed a nomination to run, or whether they actually file a nomination to run in the future.\\n\\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be official statements by the listed individual (ex: via speech, social media, etc.), however a consensus of credible reporting may also be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-steve-bannon-announce-a-presidential-run-before-2027\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/bannon.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/bannon.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"12289487662955869851422193234539525337284859774210851152451091450635938444417\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.15,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"113585128461808554139088332956774914584404743535283179667078778495379772593123\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.85,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Celebrities\",\"President\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-25T19:49:27Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x7a5ce7ceb8a77b024fa14c123e8267b7ab23ceb53d63b270d92517747e6ece81\",\"question_id\":\"0x16786cfefc61103eaf23868e7e298984f96e716f69088c77a7a07c091fc1ee02\",\"question\":\"Will Kenyan McDuffie win the 2026 Democratic D.C. Mayoral Primary?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the winner of the Democratic primary election for the mayor of Washington D.C., scheduled to be held June 16, 2026.\\n\\nIf no 2026 D.C. Democratic Mayoral Primary takes place, this market will resolve to “Other.”\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be the first official announcement of the results from the D.C. Democratic Party; however, an overwhelming consensus of credible reporting may suffice.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-kenyan-mcduffie-win-the-2026-democratic-dc-mayoral-primary\",\"end_date_iso\":null,\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x16786cfefc61103eaf23868e7e298984f96e716f69088c77a7a07c091fc1ee00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0xdbaac4f311b70b8c069903c48fe43a1e1a98d472d5320b1c50cd3e2e2945ddd9\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/who-will-win-the-2026-democratic-dc-mayoral-primary-Dk_lpq5A2WdL.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/who-will-win-the-2026-democratic-dc-mayoral-primary-Dk_lpq5A2WdL.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"33858854292344606863981037847842970355239568335430833403058758334514294336803\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.385,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"73626689983569351859369027860300234696111933050031913206993519280404239065928\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.615,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-05T19:32:55Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x53df5241badaf209246d9f7df107ff37fe439d626a4c62c7f2cbd608c8541292\",\"question_id\":\"0xd236202711ffec581f33f9c002