stion. Candidates other than the Democratic or Republican nominee (e.g., Greens, Libertarian, independent) may be added at a later date.\\n\\nCandidates who run as independents will not be encompassed by the “Democrat” or “Republican” options regardless of any affiliation they may have with the party.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the Associated Press, Fox News, and NBC. This market will resolve once all three sources call the race for the same candidate. If all three sources haven’t called the race in this state for the same candidate, this market will resolve based on the official certification.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-republicans-win-the-mississippi-senate-race-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":null,\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xee4444c07438ebbe287fd6cc418904767958703ae75663d5c3f38ef650f85b00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x52c301f8461cf75d67b8d63e6ee7a68c85263b2239f00922bc3a0160481bf46f\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-republican-party-control-the-senate-after-the-2026-midterm-elections-JSsqogfn0U0u.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-republican-party-control-the-senate-after-the-2026-midterm-elections-JSsqogfn0U0u.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":100,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"36589074670521348842786325911391532620430247097981345860356484520500173888573\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.88,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"4639340586725578716005500791739559303082924048072534329825226706547465941088\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.12,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"US Election\",\"Midterms\",\"Mississippi Midterm\",\"Senate midterms\"]},{\"e