 entity acquires control of Warner Bros. Discovery's studios and streaming businesses by June 30, 2027, 11:59 PM ET, this market will resolve to \\\"None by June 30 2027\\\". \\n\\nResolution will be based on by a consensus of reporting.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-paramount-close-warner-bros-acquisition\",\"end_date_iso\":null,\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xe8da9a2cb1cca11fe0760d70d59d7a020bb90c9e1ba86141b31144e5f70beb00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x1a42e73bb851c6cc51cde29cb59a711c469c78c68f9f7e34e91bccd3cd0526d0\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/who-will-close-warner-bros-acquisition-ZmMrkGXdrnZL.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/who-will-close-warner-bros-acquisition-ZmMrkGXdrnZL.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":5}],\"min_size\":100,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"23256019137586319539165692276469250213112768854758556344817552607255928262054\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.705,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"12068609223027041437214952122316923930875444851110633205851320421601762942510\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.295,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Tech\",\"Big Tech\",\"Warner Bros\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-08-28T16:38:27Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0xfcde7eec764a4e3dd2c43e92efec3cd23d8df64cceff357914a31d2c7820a6ea\",\"question_id\":\"0x7290258558ce3876d14fbe4237797268c0068bd245a2347ba560254067621ad8\",\"question\":\"Taylor Swift pregnant before marriage?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to \\\"Yes\\\" if Taylor Swift announce