 market will resolve to \\\"Other\\\".\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be a consensus of official sources, including https://www.sos.ca.gov/.\\n\\nAny replacement of the nominees before election day will not change the resolution of the market.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-nicholas-finan-advance-from-the-ca-17-primary\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-02T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/ca-22-primary-winners-9Nxjyi0j7xS3.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/ca-22-primary-winners-9Nxjyi0j7xS3.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"100931196156780773936860333410424088383664245317254890848647559904673392203206\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.075,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"107573961676542004720641473875466316290341607079046975665366483339722744547341\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.925,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\",\"primary elections\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-10-13T23:26:05Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x62d780b6f32de4d5b221109eb8e6c77e13d2617d6a11724366ab8ca727927be7\",\"question_id\":\"0xe0ff15139f33ac2213472326966df60d2022041f0e1b50cc5529101ede21ca01\",\"question\":\"Will the Republicans win the Minnesota governor race in 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the winner of the 2026 Minnesota gubernatorial election.\\n\\nA candidate shall be considered to represent