s-dip-to-160b-by-december-31--yaJ2zsT1qPA.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-others-dip-to-160b-by-december-31--yaJ2zsT1qPA.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"24460320816938751114475276802612882924965487949701402552708139025866329833662\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.635,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"80375623348012336803025398354743266722890754705731005456305486566399731751049\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.365,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Crypto\",\"Crypto Prices\",\"Hit Price\",\"Yearly\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-06T00:46:03Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x6680cae9b37261f6c1ec3313f9ad175708bb9722e94285b5b0a5b50a9972d312\",\"question_id\":\"0xca3e6d866434291855e71f79828e2d622bd54f14c739155acee7a80a8f278b10\",\"question\":\"Will Israel win Eurovision 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to the country whose candidate for Eurovision 2026 wins.\\n\\nIf at any point it is impossible for the listed candidate to win Eurovision 2026 based on the rules of the competition (i.e. they are eliminated), this market may immediately resolve to \\\"No\\\".\\n\\nIf no winner is announced by July 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET, this market will resolve \\\"Other\\\". All ties will be broken according to EBU's official Eurovision rules.\\n\\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be official information from Eurovision (https://eurovision.tv/), including live footage of Eurovision 2026, however a consensus of credible reporting will suffice.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-israel-win-eurovision-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-05-16T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xca3e6d866434291855e71f79828e2d622bd54f14c739155acee7a80a8f278b00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0xdbb31e74f7b54aeb439decbe7745fed1c832f325664fe4a2aa0fc06be027c492\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-israel-win-eurovision-2026-0edU-nTuqtLs.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-israel-win-eurovision-2026-0edU-nTuqtLs.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":2}],\"min_size\":100,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"95405575911585769697099772472184152032778179663119942855636123308055234853243\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.0345,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"76487264613640230657932720332362740037458034745187487375171051266713538415108\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.9655,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Awards\",\"Music\",\"Culture\",\"rewards 100, 4.5, 100\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-18T20:37:53Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x0a95717208bdb1c1167877eb5b19085494f68ed9b074d8dfc7d76b549fcbe7bb\",\"question_id\":\"0x706479f3aca475f680578aec1829db6f5b9592cdc69aa7b9bdf9543dcf14b90a\",\"question\":\"Will the Fed’s upper bound reach 5.0% or higher before 2027?\",\"description\":\"The FED interest rates are defined in this market by the lower or the upper bound of the target federal funds range. The decisions on the target federal fund range are made by the Federal Open Market Committee (FOMC) meetings.\\n\\nThis market will resolve to “Yes” if the lower or the upper bound of the target federal funds rate reaches the specified level at any point by December 31, 2026, 12:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to “No.”\\n\\nEmergency rate cuts and hikes outside the regularly scheduled meetings will be considered.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the official website of the Federal Reserve at:\\nhttps://www.federalreserve.gov/monetarypolicy/openmarket.htm.\\n\\nThis market may resolve as soon as the relevant data showing the reached level is published.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-feds-upper-bound-reach-5pt0-or-higher-before-2027-783\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/fed-rate-cut-in-2025-8aDiUiuri3_D.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/fed-rate-cut-in-2025-8aDiUiuri3_D.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":2}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"97074613377364157146536275618954700131815815082975930040025951399535510211743\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.0415,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"29757683089125131854278711382173326661055338509428068229468982779247847262156\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.9585,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Fed\",\"Fed Rates\",\"Economy\",\"Jerome Powell\",\"Economic Policy\",\"Macro Indicators\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-18T20:37:47Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x4e15f0f425d28b87024ba9f19504e074da257e3d231d3222618a67c5c0f600ba\",\"question_id\":\"0x25a8fb3c36f7aa5645d5c2d025940e7a522dd7a255e96f07b7e25d143dfe6569\",\"question\":\"Will the Fed’s lower bound reach 0.5% or lower before 2027?\",\"description\":\"The FED interest rates are defined in this market by the lower or the upper bound of the target federal funds range. The decisions on the target federal fund range are made by the Federal Open Market Committee (FOMC) meetings.\\n\\nThis market will resolve to “Yes” if the lower or the upper bound of the target federal funds rate reaches the specified level at any point by December 31, 2026, 12:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to “No.”\\n\\nEmergency rate cuts and hikes outside the regularly scheduled meetings will be considered.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the official website of the Federal Reserve at:\\nhttps://www.federalreserve.gov/monetarypolicy/openmarket.htm.\\n\\nThis market may resolve as soon as the relevant data showing the reached level is published.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-feds-lower-bound-reach-0pt5-or-lower-before-2027-459-115-473-497-424-381-849\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/fed-rate-cut-in-2025-8aDiUiuri3_D.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/fed-rate-cut-in-2025-8aDiUiuri3_D.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791bca1f2de4661ed88a30c99a7a9449aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"114143552232719777271227815999686326483032207634989652712593588125140631174786\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.047,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"84470704732360873522905129048620546298750807614862862918358737795068875599177\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.953,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Fed\",\"Fed Rates\",\"Economy\",\"Jerome Powell\",\"Economic Policy\",\"Macro Indicators\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-26T23:38:35Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xdf88e78e59e5d854aeb115c92516972420d25815540d8b1418f03db92f0b3a5b\",\"question_id\":\"0xccb5401a5f9ff36cf5f0b15c318c3174c461856c497d3e6b0c09ad53c5465506\",\"question\":\"Will Silver (SI) settle at $100-$115 in June?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the official CME settlement price for the Active Month of Silver futures on the final trading day of June 2026.\\n\\nIf the reported value falls exactly between two brackets, then this market will resolve to the higher range bracket.\\n\\nIf the final trading day of the month is shortened (for example, due to a market-holiday schedule), the official settlement price published for that shortened session will still be used for resolution. If no settlement price is published for that session, the market will use the most recent published settlement for the Active Month during June.\\n\\nFor CME Silver (SI) futures contracts, the Active Month is the nearest of CME's designated delivery-cycle months (March, May, July, September, December) that is not the spot month. The Active Month becomes a non-active month effective on its First Position Date, at which point the next eligible contract month becomes the Active Month.\\n\\nOnly the Active Month's official settlement price published by CME Group will be considered. Intraday trades, highs, lows, bids, offers, midpoint values, or indicative prices do not count.\\n\\nNote that the settlement price may differ from the last traded price. CME's methodology to determine the settlement price can vary by commodity and contract.\\n\\nOnly days during June on which CME publishes an official settlement price for the Active Month will be included. Days without settlement prices (weekends, holidays, or market closures) are ignored.\\n\\nThis market will resolve based on the settlement price as it appears on the CME settlement page at the time it is first published for the relevant trading day, regardless of any later corrections or updates.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the CME Group website — specifically, the daily \\\"Settlement\\\" price for the Active Month of Silver (SI) futures.\",\"market_slug\":\"si-settle-100-115-jun-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-30T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xccb5401a5f9ff36cf5f0b15c318c3174c461856c497d3e6b0c09ad53c5465500\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x316a60075230654a44d02f775f6de5a3f06909e529a07b7fcd4ce876c1a75c9c\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/silver-3d81e98448.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/silver-3d81e98448.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":2}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"79874717115167927782900365559583870716582553045618441173775590911882436531258\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.115,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"94558665561721318376736792472030560691861536877999508010733586627863088661256\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.885,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Finance\",\"Silver\",\"Commodities\",\"Hide From New\",\"COMEX Silver Futures\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-10-13T21:35:49Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x3ce6295fd9f1a6e2798a8a8a8845f69aca182b8cf35dc59db7203415cbe8d48e\",\"question_id\":\"0xdbf0dffb3b5c82a967b89617f6a114a47243b9a73ea039cd0f1e9301e6e5bf00\",\"question\":\"Will the Democrats win the New Mexico Senate race in 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the winner of the 2026 midterm New Mexico U.S. Senate election, inclusive of any run-offs.\\n\\nA candidate shall be considered to represent a party in the event that he or she is the nominee of the party in question. Candidates other than the Democratic or Republican nominee (e.g., Greens, Libertarian, independent) may be added at a later date.\\n\\nCandidates who run as independents will not be encompassed by the “Democrat” or “Republican” options regardless of any affiliation they may have with the party.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the Associated Press, Fox News, and NBC. This market will resolve once all three sources call the race for the same candidate. If all three sources haven’t called the race in this state for the same candidate, this market will resolve based on the official certification.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-democrats-win-the-new-mexico-senate-race-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":null,\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xdbf0dffb3b5c82a967b89617f6a114a47243b9a73ea039cd0f1e9301e6e5bf00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x6af7deb608b29dc8fc1bfc027c41aecd2659e635cafea2727a3d9e6e98567e45\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-democratic-party-control-the-senate-after-the-2026-midterm-elections-JJ9h02JGR09z.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-democratic-party-control-the-senate-after-the-2026-midterm-elections-JJ9h02JGR09z.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"86827974851753312617441915824618617861250657564707166327567168877893121374182\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.9585,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"36658361636301944946350626333493677081031062692438134395348552977069133544334\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.0415,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"US Election\",\"Midterms\",\"New Mexico Midterm\",\"Senate midterms\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-18T20:49:01Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x1743369a669efb77a1522e296a1b894f23289cf7f4eb0ced7a6294ec118ba674\",\"question_id\":\"0x6483474fbb240f910fe699259af9012925e185f3c7f16ea442131ec2d1aaf906\",\"question\":\"Will Alex Pelbath be the Republican Nominee for SC-01?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the candidate who wins the nomination for the Republican Party to contest the SC-01 congressional district seat in the U.S. House of Representatives in the 2026 midterm elections. The Republican primary will take place on June 9, 2026.\\n\\nIf no nominee is announced by November 3, 2026, 11:59PM ET, this market will resolve to \\\"Other\\\".\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be a consensus of official Republican sources, including https://www.rnc.org/.\\n\\nAny replacement of the nominee before election day will not change the resolution of the market.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-alex-pelbath-be-the-republican-nominee-for-sc-01\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-09T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x6483474fbb240f910fe699259af9012925e185f3c7f16ea442131ec2d1aaf900\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x43c2db5ebad94829d3b04a25b6eddf25da732bd66dda919e25c6a25f390cffb3\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/south-carolina-governor-democratic-primary-winner-JcrLjxqeFLcJ.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/south-carolina-governor-democratic-primary-winner-JcrLjxqeFLcJ.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"59320203914662383650708513581313169074590646877239680563022769102890235696938\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.16,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"53379508209154180860469729895633406940297109243190653597144069090090410986296\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.84,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\",\"primary elections\",\"Republican Primary\",\"South Carolina Primary\",\"House Primary\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2026-01-13T23:16:40Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x4caf4c1f5e9294a32e922c14d3d48c67d2748f0482d6e4ae74c93f6ad43d91bb\",\"question_id\":\"0x8cd6307f08deca983363c782cd9e59ecf37439f0d25826960f40ea6ed1a3282f\",\"question\":\"Will Republicans lose House majority before the midterms?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to “Yes” if the Republican party ceases to hold a majority in the United States House of Representatives at any point before polls open for the 2026 U.S. House of Representatives elections scheduled for November 3, 2026. Otherwise, this market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nA majority in the House of Representatives means holding more than half of the currently seated voting members of the U.S. House at that time, excluding vacant seats. Ties do not qualify as a majority.  \\n\\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be official information from the United States House of Representatives Press Gallery (https://pressgallery.house.gov/member-data/party-breakdown); however, a consensus of credible reporting may also be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-republicans-lose-house-majority-before-the-midterms\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-11-03T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-republicans-lose-house-majority-before-the-midterms-g-Y1ouFkzg_h.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-republicans-lose-house-majority-before-the-midterms-g-Y1ouFkzg_h.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":2}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"82155281377141165143204560708045813743531231692081828482927028490588408258574\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.145,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"55178006458331538097760352290708491389679587355834895003301404997679920341820\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.855,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"republican party\",\"house of representatives\",\"Congress\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-13T21:18:04Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0xd8c1b0a73653b1fb4fb6e8d13d0063d25810870d7ddf83e61fffb4de4522edf1\",\"question_id\":\"0x9f3a324fa030100f49873bd232abc2cc20520d6b72b5aab760cfdd348c894268\",\"question\":\"Negative GDP growth in 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to 'Yes' if the seasonally adjusted and annualized GDP growth rate for the full year 2026, as derived from the 'Advance Estimate' for Q4 2026, with a release by the U.S. Bureau of Economic Analysis (BEA) expected in January 2027, reports a growth rate below 0. Otherwise, this market will resolve to 'No'.\\n\\nThe GDP release will be available at: https://www.bea.gov/data/gdp/gross-domestic-product.\\n\\nOnly the first available GDP report labeled as the 'Advance Estimate' for Q4 2026, which provides the initial full-year 2026 GDP growth rate, will be used for resolution. Any subsequent revisions or updates to the data will not be considered.\",\"market_slug\":\"negative-gdp-growth-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2027-01-29T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":\"2025-11-25T18:00:00Z\",\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/negative-gdp-growth-in-q1-2025-3cqoJCDM0Qs1.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/negative-gdp-growth-in-q1-2025-3cqoJCDM0Qs1.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"45429668890056162364307617807576387840293305143387096943585488315586563658159\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.054,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"63147276005126770880954125047261230986291997315680909701649556277988435329355\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.946,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"GDP\",\"Economy\",\"Macro Single\",\"Macro Indicators\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-06T00:46:03Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x28872d7d6f63cc8e4172a1825ce9694898f3e94e1f6f97496896d77bb54ef502\",\"question_id\":\"0xca3e6d866434291855e71f79828e2d622bd54f14c739155acee7a80a8f278b11\",\"question\":\"Will Italy win Eurovision 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to the country whose candidate for Eurovision 2026 wins.\\n\\nIf at any point it is impossible for the listed candidate to win Eurovision 2026 based on the rules of the competition (i.e. they are eliminated), this market may immediately resolve to \\\"No\\\".\\n\\nIf no winner is announced by July 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET, this market will resolve \\\"Other\\\". All ties will be broken according to EBU's official Eurovision rules.\\n\\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be official information from Eurovision (https://eurovision.tv/), including live footage of Eurovision 2026, however a consensus of credible reporting will suffice.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-italy-win-eurovision-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-05-16T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xca3e6d866434291855e71f79828e2d622bd54f14c739155acee7a80a8f278b00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x3bbca144a8ab345a0679def1713740e4bdb05c302fbf79af734ebd5875d2b97b\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-italy-win-eurovision-2026-k53NnOjBwG1Y.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-italy-win-eurovision-2026-k53NnOjBwG1Y.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":100,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"103965838880629258162850334568721069152035150178793840229081938589671420946069\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.0215,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"92387849785958608854241813313501025693454360647697662432296641859450521424216\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.9785,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Awards\",\"Music\",\"Culture\",\"rewards 100, 4.5, 100\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-30T21:42:17Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x3e685c84773bd018fff4219185b904b2ef194671320f47648121d07d2ae2cc17\",\"question_id\":\"0x872bc572bdcc177bcb2acf724b802f3925b28a2691f9454e8e6ea6cd6429426f\",\"question\":\"Trump eliminates capital gains tax on crypto before 2027?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to \\\"Yes\\\" if Donald Trump signs a bill into law or performs any executive action changing US tax law to eliminate capital gains tax on any cryptocurrency assets by December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to \\\"No\\\".\\n\\nSuch a bill must apply to US taxpaying persons in general; if a law applies only to specific companies or institutions, it will not qualify toward a \\\"Yes\\\" resolution to this market.\\n\\nIf capital gains is eliminated only for specific types or classes of crypto assets (e.g., only Bitcoin or Ethereum, only American issued cryptocurrencies, or only NFTs), it will still count toward a \\\"Yes\\\" resolution for this market.\\n\\nIf the bill is signed into law, or executive action is instituted before the resolution date, it will suffice to resolve this market to \\\"Yes\\\" regardless of when it takes effect.\\n\\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be official information from the US federal government, however a consensus of credible reporting will also be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"trump-eliminates-capital-gains-tax-on-crypto-before-2027\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2025-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/trump-eliminates-capital-gains-tax-on-crypto-in-2025-_d4c7AqsRTXO.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/trump-eliminates-capital-gains-tax-on-crypto-in-2025-_d4c7Aqs