licy/openmarket.htm.\\n\\nThis market may resolve as soon as the relevant data showing the reached level is published.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-feds-upper-bound-reach-4pt25-or-higher-before-2027\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/fed-rate-cut-in-2025-8aDiUiuri3_D.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/fed-rate-cut-in-2025-8aDiUiuri3_D.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":2}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"61062406867911041129444957488064832751656470638547318929199585136855635802073\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.0745,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"113095434114001328719435424564843828765562067858288752999942506274129979440840\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.9255,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Fed\",\"Fed Rates\",\"Economy\",\"Jerome Powell\",\"Economic Policy\",\"Macro Indicators\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-18T20:37:51Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x0bbbcca922e19937c88530c715742a6c4c5d951e3e91e2c37d3053ed6e820c81\",\"question_id\":\"0xc120d36aa0b8b9361e5a3121109590b61c4d67b95e01c99131c1d3d1bca38544\",\"question\":\"Will the Fed’s lower bound reach 2.25% or lower before 2027?\",\"description\":\"The FED interest rates are defined in this market by the lower or the upper bound of the target federal funds range. The decisions on the target federal fund range are made by the Federal Open Market Committee (FOMC) meetings.\\n\\nThis 