urovision-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-05-16T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xca3e6d866434291855e71f79828e2d622bd54f14c739155acee7a80a8f278b00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x3d70cb3e94343d6b2f56b1bc8ef4cd72e5f7e04d20028d3ebaf911c1ca04fc62\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-sweden-win-eurovision-2026-kewEcEyQardO.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-sweden-win-eurovision-2026-kewEcEyQardO.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":100,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"73724195992086477765138842862409589386605408211483635259048596665225946159897\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.0245,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"103802463400627900243244836848362452277230523163204185449553443177457246140022\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.9755,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Awards\",\"Music\",\"Culture\",\"rewards 100, 4.5, 100\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-07-29T17:22:45Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x0fb006e0c06caa4db12f7e30ec8c2483d658f83eb57b2ee8eb478e39beca3dfd\",\"question_id\":\"0x3e140cadcdda618e09c3bc308ce6fb65d4623f7477eb887ea4d03d54aa6ad70c\",\"question\":\"Will Ivan Cepeda Castro win the 2026 Colombian presidential election?\",\"description\":\"Colombia's presidential elections are scheduled for May 31, 2026, and a second round (if required) on June 21, 2026, in case no candidate secures more than 50% of the valid votes in the first round.\\n\\nThis market will resolve according to the listed candidate that wins this election. \\n\\nThis market includes any potential second round. If the result of this election isn't known by December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET, the market will resolve to \\\"Other\\\".\\n\\nThis market will resolve based on the election results, as indicated by a consensus of credible reporting. If there is ambiguity, this market will resolve based solely on the official results as reported by Colombia's National Civil Registry (Registraduría Nacional del Estado Civil) (https://registraduria.gov.co).\",\"market_slug\":\"will-ivan-cepeda-castro-win-the-2026-colombian-presidential-election\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-21T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x3e140cadcdda618e09c3bc308ce6fb65d4623f7477eb887ea4d03d54aa6ad700\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x545a7ca8aade25f41885c6d2550b136c47ee9afe4679d6d319b547ec154f8ea5\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-ivan-cepeda-castro-win-the-2026-colombian-presidential-election-Nc6-bsFm3eq7.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-ivan-cepeda-castro-win-the-2026-colombian-presidential-election-Nc6-bsFm3eq7.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":79}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"62374557612691330043510053829591470998236327248924987579815802826988260253261\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.365,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"45225184915026490412090111842887484470550126139644389135401954155408710524398\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.635,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Global Elections\",\"World Elections\",\"Colombia\",\"World\",\"Rewards 200, 4.5, 50\",\"Colombia Election\",\"Main Election\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2026-01-04T20:08:35Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x3de0f3d7d7efb40cde68e814d40a0b232832083653c8e78260eb999baa967de0\",\"question_id\":\"0x1e5bca70226332c809c3e32f64ba39865eb3bc669baa89241006c9064d4b0441\",\"question\":\"US strike on Cuba by December 31?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to \\\"Yes\\\" if a US-initiated drone, missile, or air strike on the soil of Cuba is announced or credibly reported to have occurred by the listed date ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to \\\"No\\\".\\n\\nFor the purposes of this market, a qualifying \\\"strike\\\" is defined as the use of aerial bombs, drones, or missiles (including FPV and ATGM strikes as well as cruise or ballistic missiles) launched by any United States operatives, including military forces, intelligence agencies, or other U.S. government operatives, that physically impact ground territory within the listed country.\\n\\nA strike on any area within the terrestrial territory (including rivers, lakes, ports, but excluding territorial sea) of the listed country counts.\\n\\nMissiles or drones that are intercepted and surface-to-air missile strikes will not be sufficient for a \\\"Yes\\\" resolution, regardless of whether they land territory or cause damage.\\n\\nActions such as artillery fire, small arms fire, ground incursions, naval shelling, or cyberattacks will not qualify.\\n\\nAny strike occurring during this market’s timeframe that is claimed by either Donald Trump or the U.S. government will qualify.\\n\\nThe primary resolution source will be a consensus of credible reporting.\\n\\nThis market will remain open until the end of the second day after the resolution time. If the date/time of a qualifying strike cannot be confirmed by a consensus of credible reporting by that time, it will resolve to \\\"No\\\" regardless of whether a strike was later confirmed to have taken place.\",\"market_slug\":\"us-strike-on-cuba-by-december-31\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":0,\"taker_base_fee\":0,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/us-strike-on-cuba-by-december-31-pSKqauf5Hk1c.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/us-strike-on-cuba-by-december-31-pSKqauf5Hk1c.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":20}],\"min_size\":100,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"91347242536105459969213788769929618447748782724898414007495579710952664644740\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.365,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"55782999195478978645683058282751482473275270795090145277907596121415418369349\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.635,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Venezuela\",\"Geopolitics\",\"Cuba\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-10T21:36:50Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xd4607b688346dfbe7b5fa5e805d16e5b7878d60bf2e1d4c7c0192665ffeafdf9\",\"question_id\":\"0xfc6702869339bf4399af0d1125342e257edc24107aee9e35af555431ffa7700a\",\"question\":\"Will Perry Johnson win the 2026 Michigan Governor Republican primary election?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the winner of the Republican Primary for Governor of Michigan, scheduled to take place on August 4, 2026. Resolution will be based on the overall winner of the primary, including any potential second round or run-off.\\n\\nIf no 2026 Michigan Gubernatorial Republican Primary takes place, this market will resolve to “Other.”\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be the first official announcement of the results from the Michigan Republican Party; however, an overwhelming consensus of credible reporting may suffice.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-perry-johnson-win-the-2026-michigan-governor-republican-primary-election\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-08-04T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xfc6702869339bf4399af0d1125342e257edc24107aee9e35af555431ffa77000\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0xd36e1f3d7f455c5615b54859e44b8d1234372b52051f0b0b2b6163fb1ba92201\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/michigan-governor-democratic-primary-winner-PwmKx6vMpZEt.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/michigan-governor-democratic-primary-winner-PwmKx6vMpZEt.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"93748218218323729208083176329945662015247621430606244410355195805925691971721\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.65,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"57220257353173185773333579333924616087696190442559192236119555005615787879907\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.35,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\",\"primary elections\",\"Republican Primary\",\"Michigan Primary\",\"Governor Primary\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-24T21:13:03Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x928fa1f1e0b2ac120a1576843b4d7df0bab8a9d0a2967c84bc46f5b928ad78b2\",\"question_id\":\"0x1320063df437fbc1fb0ec79bc9b9596a21c8d6283cc19e17c51493864ad0c91e\",\"question\":\"Will BNB reach $1600 by December 31, 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will immediately resolve to “Yes” if any Binance 1-minute candle for BNB (BNB/USDT) between November 24, 2025, 16:10 and December 31, 2026, 23:59 in the ET timezone has a final “High” price equal to or greater than the price specified in the title. Otherwise, this market will resolve to “No.”\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is Binance, specifically the BNB/USDT “High” prices available at: https://www.binance.com/en/trade/BNB_USDT with the chart set to “1m” (one-minute candles) on the top bar.\\n\\nPlease note that the outcome of this market depends solely on the price data from the Binance BNB/USDT trading pair. Prices from other exchanges, different trading pairs, or spot markets will not be considered for the resolution of this market.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-bnb-reach-1600-by-december-31-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2027-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/bnb-all-time-high-by-december-31-MRsmG1FSYuSN.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/bnb-all-time-high-by-december-31-MRsmG1FSYuSN.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791bca1f2de4661ed88a30c99a7a9449aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"83367326357932454629294612929576146350424899980046960187998751497155082913035\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.074,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"70702398024871686071790271040970019484225781672779088733113555869683894739148\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.926,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Crypto\",\"Crypto Prices\",\"Hit Price\",\"Yearly\",\"BNB\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_