s from Taylor Swift or her representatives; however, a definitive consensus of credible media reporting may be considered.\",\"market_slug\":\"taylor-swift-pregnant-before-2027\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/taylor-swift-pregnant-in-2025-5cpC3Ir4u5Pd.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/taylor-swift-pregnant-in-2025-5cpC3Ir4u5Pd.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"44827572479353518081244438746113968420401867280288091969239280589388541478697\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.23,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"98165997526504155072211489624964995141099749875757338865080345428663813769275\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.77,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Music\",\"Celebrities\",\"Taylor Swift\",\"Culture\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-27T15:34:19Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x5ab165053e4658271eb3f6a6fd36f59169b076fd7583971a6543dc6b0a12fb1d\",\"question_id\":\"0xc52191907032b2d00a1088fb4030d181ce26865de58539c4d1a557978d45a768\",\"question\":\"Will ThreadGuy appear on the UpOnly podcast by December 31?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to “Yes” if a new episode of the UpOnly podcast featuring the specified guest is publicly released by December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET. Otherwise, it will resolve to “No.”\\n\\n“Released” means the full episode is published and available to the general public on an official UpOnly platform (e.g. YouTube, Spotify, Apple Podcasts, or the show’s official feed).\\n\\nPreviews, clips, teasers, or promotional material do not count toward resolution.\\n\\nThe resolution source will be the official UpOnly podcast channels and/or a consensus of credible public reporting.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-threadguy-appear-on-the-uponly-podcast-by-december-31-992\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2027-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/up-only-podcast-released-by-october-31-ow-THGHcO8pn.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/up-only-podcast-released-by-october-31-ow-THGHcO8pn.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791bca1f2de4661ed88a30c99a7a9449aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"85516621368759264138800624348403229071870759991231628575124374806572279067971\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.465,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"110286984447224083899206213035885538589550913647007042410396391120410611410088\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.535,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Crypto\",\"Up Only\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-16T20:14:05Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0xae6d3d20bc8f742922dc40880cd8a8671c10385a9912fa7cd670fba0643dfe96\",\"question_id\":\"0xadb7e58e8bc49f689db034724fc75b1dff8ca055bba20d5a883853227974d200\",\"question\":\"Will Rafael López Aliaga win the 2026 Peruvian presidential election?\",\"description\":\"General elections are scheduled to be held in Peru on April 12, 2026.\\n\\nThis market will resolve according to the listed candidate who wins the next Peruvian Presidential election. \\n\\nThis market includes any potential second round. \\n\\nIf the results are not known definitively by October 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET, this market will resolve to \\\"Other\\\".\\n\\nThis market will resolve based on the results of this election, as indicated by a consensus of credible reporting. If there is ambiguity, this market will resolve solely on the official results as reported by the Peruvian government, specifically the National Office of Electoral Processes (Oficina Nacional de Procesos Electorales, ONPE) (https://www.onpe.gob.pe/elecciones/) and the National Jury of Elections (Jurado Nacional de Elecciones, JNE) (https://portal.jne.gob.pe/portal/)\",\"market_slug\":\"will-rafael-lpez-aliaga-win-the-2026-peruvian-presidential-election\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-07T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xadb7e58e8bc49f689db034724fc75b1dff8ca055bba20d5a883853227974d200\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0xe70f09f3cd85d79673d747bbe1a2da1a035d6e39e60c8128e9edc14dc2b026c6\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-rafael-lpez-aliaga-win-the-2026-peruvian-presidential-election-X72XjUcYKC0d.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-rafael-lpez-aliaga-win-the-2026-peruvian-presidential-election-X72XjUcYKC0d.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"91464516107556165907566387619157396733019262339196802152206657889196699256450\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.0205,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"25945415793931624559794421130954173506522916582203134613102786444988212496867\",\"outcome\":\"No\