specified in the title 1 day after launch. Otherwise, the market will resolve to \\\"No.\\\"\\n\\nThe token must be actively, publicly transferable and tradable to be considered a launch.\\n\\nThe FDV will be determined using the total token supply multiplied by the token price.\\n\\n\\\"1 day after launch\\\" is defined as 4:00 PM ET on the calendar day following launch. The resolution source for this market is the most liquid price source available. If Pacifica (https://x.com/pacifica_fi) doesn't launch a token by December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET, this market will resolve to \\\"No\\\".\",\"market_slug\":\"pacifica-fdv-above-500m-one-day-after-launch-171\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2027-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-pacifica-launch-a-token-by-_F1le2wsW8WR.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-pacifica-launch-a-token-by-_F1le2wsW8WR.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"73356786969251784817826404028517173197879713599890594338261597978307275085695\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.12,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"110476477646772004841888273715124389648284755258005424945842664345821399209553\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.88,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Crypto\",\"FDV\",\"Pre-Market\",\"Pacifica\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-10-13T21:36:05Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xd103195d48bf6183e28c4140bd374dd3e907e8f8d411374cb4d2d124ec4c216d\",\"question_id\":\"0xda955e65203ced65f983c4bcbb9a24ce5262e316f6c4f5c1382a12c7c310b701\",\"question\":\"Will the Republicans win the Montana Senate race in 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the winner of the 2026 midterm Montana U.S. Senate election, inclusive of any run-offs.\\n\\nA candidate shall be considered to represent a party in the event that he or she is the nominee of the party in question. Candidates other than the Democratic or Republican nominee (e.g., Greens, Libertarian, independent) may be added at a later date.\\n\\nCandidates who run as independents will not be encompassed by the “Democrat” or “Republican” options regardless of any affiliation they may have with the party.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the Associated Press, Fox News, and NBC. This market will resolve once all three sources call the race for the same candidate. If all three sources haven’t called the race in this state for the same candidate, this market will resolve based on the official certification.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-republicans-win-the-montana-senate-race-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":null,\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xda955e65203ced65f983c4bcbb9a24ce5262e316f6c4f5c1382a12c7c310b700\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0xdf253aa9dd9d115e906f1902a71626556cad8f90bf5b94dd4de6b5a0d75dcb8c\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-republican-party-control-the-senate-after-the-2026-midterm-elections-JSsqogfn0U0u.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-republican-party-control-the-senate-after-the-2026-midterm-elections-JSsqogfn0U0u.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"102325039069045369431277041414667266705633344716966967751024692805337688459829\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.78,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"58046186222956557148380567481022348507421740788139654872430510492438761636276\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.22,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"US Election\",\"Midterms\",\"Montana Midterm\",\"Senate midterms\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-09-29T22:24:25Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0xd4e77ba6f29fc093509d24f508631abd445ecf506bbdc9c4c80e60256a318527\",\"question_id\":\"0xdcd7daabcacdc4ecf4f9a48d0a2708b52f356dd086c8070992136da62eb72b00\",\"question\":\"Will no Fed rate cuts happen in 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the exact amount of cuts of 25 basis points in 2026 by the Fed (including any cuts made during the December meeting).\\n\\nEmergency rate cuts outside of scheduled FOMC meetings will also count toward the total number of cuts in 2026. This market will remain open until December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET, to account for any such emergency actions.\\n\\nFor example, if the Fed cuts rates by 50 bps after a meeting, it would be considered 2 cuts (of 25 bps each).\\n\\nThis market will resolve early to \\\"No\\\" if the specified number of cuts becomes impossible — i.e., if more cuts have already occurred than the strike in question.\\n\\nNote that cuts between 1–24 bps (inclusive) will also be considered 1 rate cut.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be FOMC statements after meetings scheduled in 2026 according to the official calendar: https://www.federalreserve.gov/monetarypolicy/fomccalendars.htm. The level and change of the target federal funds rate is also published at the official website of the Federal Reserve at https://www.federalreserve.gov/monetarypolicy/openmarket.htm.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-no-fed-rate-cuts-happen-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xdcd7daabcacdc4ecf4f9a48d0a2708b52f356dd086c8070992136da62eb72b00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x159cca36bb3b42c0b9a26cfdbade0ab8297bc14b6c097130912730bef83c7b90\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/how-many-fed-rate-cuts-in-2025-9qstZkSL1dn0.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/how-many-fed-rate-cuts-in-2025-9qstZkSL1dn0.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":139}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"12403602920039269077597917340921667997547115084613238528792639013246536343316\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.5745,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"21294592205022969346730955103773391901993330222644504059576935265667917187903\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.4255,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Business\",\"Finance\",\"Fed\",\"Fed Rates\",\"Economy\",\"Jerome Powell\",\"Economic Policy\",\"Rewards 200, 4.5, 50\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-10-13T22:28:59Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x460d3942d385cdeda20519c0c5ad804ae48dc18efc9a82e1f1be87a29e69adb3\",\"question_id\":\"0x82cc8472987cbe607955a29017c930096689633ca5d9fc80b0a0ce3bdcabe100\",\"question\":\"Will the Democrats win the Kansas Senate race in 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the winner of the 2026 midterm Kansas U.S. Senate election, inclusive of any run-offs.\\n\\nA candidate shall be considered to represent a party in the event that he or she is the nominee of the party in question. Candidates other than the Democratic or Republican nominee (e.g., Greens, Libertarian, independent) may be added at a later date.\\n\\nCandidates who run as independents will not be encompassed by the “Democrat” or “Republican” options regardless of any affiliation they may have with the party.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the Associated Press, Fox News, and NBC. This market will resolve once all three sources call the race for the same candidate. If all three sources haven’t called the race in this state for the same candidate, this market will resolve based on the official certification.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-democrats-win-the-kansas-senate-race-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":null,\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x82cc8472987cbe607955a29017c930096689633ca5d9fc80b0a0ce3bdcabe100\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x73a86baf259d55188e1c0849ef28de573f9790dd44698cc2088bfddca11ca84c\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-democratic-party-control-the-senate-after-the-2026-midterm-elections-JJ9h02JGR09z.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-democratic-party-control-the-senate-after-the-2026-midterm-elections-JJ9h02JGR09z.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"75079868093228966915894372964099062660587490227046756021175661325867722540666\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.195,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"37327444084035787269854507880662541101916131726641992937390933740081521292625\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.805,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"US Election\",\"Midterms\",\"Kansas Midterm\",\"Senate midterms\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2026-01-06T19:00:05Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x31ff4152662e8e50faff8ad80ff5561054753b27a5a4801aa95d3b08ccd2494e\",\"question_id\":\"0xa19995e5250fd003d5452c21ed5e49944550a1c5a3d89a7ffd114435947c23b1\",\"question\":\"Will Jack Thorne win the 2026 Fields Medal?\",\"description\":\"The Fields Medal is a prize regarded as the top award in the field of mathematics worldwide. It is awarded to two, three, or four mathematicians under 40 years of age at the International Congress of the International Mathematical Union (IMU), a meeting that takes place every four years. The International Congress of Mathematicians 2026 (ICM 2026) is scheduled to take place from July 23 to July 30, 2026.\\n\\nThis market will resolve according to the winners of the 2026 Fields medal.\\n\\nIf the 2026 Fields medalists are not announced by August 15, 2026, 11:59PM ET, this market will resolve to \\\"Other\\\".\\n\\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be official information from the IMU (https://www.mathunion.org/imu-awards/fields-medal), however other credible reporting may be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-jack-thorne-win-the-2026-fields-medal\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/who-will-win-the-2026-fields-medal-_Ga46CWkQrVs.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/who-will-win-the-2026-fields-medal-_Ga46CWkQrVs.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_s