ve to \\\"No\\\".\\n\\nA meeting is defined as any encounter where both listed individual and Trump are present and interact with each other in person.\\n\\nThe resolution source will be a consensus of credible reporting.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-trump-meet-with-lai-ching-te-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-trump-meet-with-lai-ching-te-in-his-first-100-days-OjvwzivH9dhK.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-trump-meet-with-lai-ching-te-in-his-first-100-days-OjvwzivH9dhK.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":3}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":5.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"99792667542810032198348275219799506523385265075068332530798893037929015413037\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.081,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"76639653998592529397905185768040254391057709439275979928923831350943911200927\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.919,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Trump\",\"Geopolitics\",\"World\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-18T20:37:55Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x8be4f92d8396e675e220e15c1ca5bca527bc22dba01d586e2118096c1fe8a4a3\",\"question_id\":\"0xecd183769a3d6d10ef06332a4f7f4e02a55a19b3db2a3e3c3e22a151321cdeaf\",\"question\":\"Will the Fed’s lower bound reach 0.25% or lower before 2027?\",\"description\":\"The FED interest rates are defined in this market by the lower or the upper bound of the target federal funds range. The decisions on the target federal fund range are made by the Federal Open Market Committee (FOMC) meetings.\\n\\nThis market will resolve to “Yes” if the lower or the upper bound of the target federal funds rate reaches the specified level at any point by December 31, 2026, 12:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to “No.”\\n\\nEmergency rate cuts and hikes outside the regularly scheduled meetings will be considered.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the official website of the Federal Reserve at:\\nhttps://www.federalreserve.gov/monetarypolicy/openmarket.htm.\\n\\nThis market may resolve as soon as the relevant data showing the reached level is published.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-feds-lower-bound-reach-0pt25-or-lower-before-2027-173-921-916-764-754-593-935\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/fed-rate-cut-in-2025-8aDiUiuri3_D.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/fed-rate-cut-in-2025-8aDiUiuri3_D.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791bca1f2de4661ed88a30c99a7a9449aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"27236599830419042459739189692977369938120329479283247973485232547052692856847\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.052,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"104756002746274813097908008371030915295278685575694517980349136199295027747814\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.948,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Fed\",\"Fed Rates\",\"Economy\",\"Jerome Powell\",\"Economic Policy\",\"Macro Indicators\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-24T21:38:11Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x60fe8a52fb9e60db0f3df143eefbe46a98e0c5e6fcb19274704d759048291f28\",\"question_id\":\"0x6df3ca56210d949c3df0adadeaa4077dc4cc8b14c43e53113aa9ac08388ca5a0\",\"question\":\"Will Chainlink dip to $6 by December 31, 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will immediately resolve to “Yes” if any Binance 1-minute candle for Chainlink (LINK/USDT) between November 24, 2025, 17:35 and December 31, 2026, 23:59 in the ET timezone has a final “Low” price equal to or lower than the price specified in the title. Otherwise, this market will resolve to “No.”\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is Binance, specifically the LINK/USDT “Low” prices available at:\\nhttps://www.binance.com/en/trade/LINK_USDT\\nwith the chart set to “1m” (one-minute candles) on the top bar.\\n\\nPlease note that the outcome of this market depends solely on the price data from the Binance LINK/USDT trading pair. Prices from other exchanges, different trading pairs, or spot markets will not be considered.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-chainlink-dip-to-6-by-december-31-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2027-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/what-price-will-chainlink-hit-in-november-gceaKlcTAViv.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/what-price-will-chainlink-hit-in-november-gceaKlcTAViv.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791bca1f2de4661ed88a30c99a7a9449aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"103193982295387910124733676652388808389107681251175025720092073155808213573039\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.465,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"61592552042335895044384923088928778353755833236645164523460752910478381849769\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.535,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Crypto\",\"Crypto Prices\",\"Hit Price\",\"Chainlink\",\"Yearly\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-10-13T21:35:53Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x378f6ce7b81670608a5a4f0fcf740e3dbb44c3e402e5b0beba49871a5c05b259\",\"question_id\":\"0xac17bb3e2188e895feeb3b5fcada2a112a98a8302404e9ba72ea341bdc62f301\",\"question\":\"Will the Republicans win the New Jersey Senate race in 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the winner of the 2026 midterm New Jersey U.S. Senate election, inclusive of any run-offs.\\n\\nA candidate shall be considered to represent a party in the event that he or she is the nominee of the party in question. Candidates other than the Democratic or Republican nominee (e.g., Greens, Libertarian, independent) may be added at a later date.\\n\\nCandidates who run as independents will not be encompassed by the “Democrat” or “Republican” options regardless of any affiliation they may have with the party.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the Associated Press, Fox News, and NBC. This market will resolve once all three sources call the race for the same candidate. If all three sources haven’t called the race in this state for the same candidate, this market will resolve based on the official certification.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-republicans-win-the-new-jersey-senate-race-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":null,\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xac17bb3e2188e895feeb3b5fcada2a112a98a8302404e9ba72ea341bdc62f300\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0xf7d4bd2cdb4d79a40ed692d31793cac015dddd37e4b9