":\"2026-08-11T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x4bab3a9af94d8e1b9742055db9d3de868ddbd51cc1767531db345a14cff3bc00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x422e0138fe65ea97a26a6501327dbb586130e16e2e76e888c5516480394efea0\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/vermont-governor-democratic-primary-winner-Bubbf7hVjNsv.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/vermont-governor-democratic-primary-winner-Bubbf7hVjNsv.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"29198208228537721527561915325386932482016341652435477161304846447922293852636\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.021,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"5117032285970150384414847649699148055738463057944710210906080627541530975189\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.979,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\",\"primary elections\",\"Democratic Primary\",\"Governor Primary\",\"Vermont Primary\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-19T20:39:51Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x399b69600812f9997ee0dcac06c74c9351f230baa53765eacbc443a77bc520b9\",\"question_id\":\"0xd8ddca48b902023eb501bb3f072584a0e3bcd2aa3d05f2b027f2545d10387700\",\"question\":\"Will Shri Thanedar be the Democratic Nominee for MI-13?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the candidate who wins the nomination for the Democratic Party to contest the MI-13 congressional district seat in the U.S. House of Representatives in the 2026 midterm elections. The Democratic primary will take place on August 4, 2026.\\n\\nIf no nominee is announced by November 3, 2026, 11:59PM ET, this market will resolve to \\\"Other\\\".\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be a consensus of official Democrat sources, including https://democrats.org/.\\n\\nAny replacement of the nominee before election day will not change the resolution of the market.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-shri-thanedar-be-the-democratic-nominee-for-mi-13\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-08-04T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xd8ddca48b902023eb501bb3f072584a0e3bcd2aa3d05f2b027f2545d10387700\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x079e9b6a1c559e652a4c3128d6b92c4e1503e56fd13a32c457651c58069740f0\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/who-will-be-the-democratic-nominee-for-mi-11-hzBEmacHeUSD.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/who-will-be-the-democratic-nominee-for-mi-11-hzBEmacHeUSD.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":3}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"60140391190972147972725614646143873455539192565387824092604601196643874302959\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.52,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"109662195595524275261718540822508102276538892129220487987001465595904763399663\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.48,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\",\"michigan\",\"primary elections\",\"Democratic Primary\",\"Michigan Primary\",\"House Primary\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-18T20:37:49Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xaa6145fb75147c5dda9bda894ed80353b14f23149b285893dd41e1edc8c0d4c2\",\"question_id\":\"0x615e0681452892d5ddd4ded2a84e638078436102698af652c4f0e45ffcc7f38f\",\"question\":\"Will the Fed’s lower bound reach 2.5% or lower before 2027?\",\"description\":\"The FED interest rates are defined in this market by the lower or the upper bound of the target federal funds range. The decisions on the target federal fund range are made by the Federal Open Market Committee (FOMC) meetings.\\n\\nThis market will resolve to “Yes” if the lower or the upper bound of the target federal funds rate reaches the specified level at any point by December 31, 2026, 12:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to “No.”\\n\\nEmergency rate cuts and hikes outside the regularly scheduled meetings will be considered.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the official website of the Federal Reserve at:\\nhttps://www.federalreserve.gov/monetarypolicy/openmarket.htm.\\n\\nThis market may resolve as soon as the relevant data showing the reached level is published.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-feds-lower-bound-reach-2pt5-or-lower-before-2027-289-849-151-768\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/fed-rate-cut-in-2025-8aDiUiuri3_D.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/fed-rate-cut-in-2025-8aDiUiuri3_D.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":5}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"33955188520896833048115959811816549716866192906937688660205174290095294083363\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.095,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"20423362327975461844489534239312100383284255615268693304859555284041698365194\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.905,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Fed\",\"Fed Rates\",\"Economy\",\"Jerome Powell\",\"Economic Policy\",\"Macro Indicators\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-10-13T22:37:51Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xdb9b47929435349bfc4f7a65e0ceb89d5cea388a87c4c6f10d0f736253ae0d76\",\"question_id\":\"0x7146f4aff656226aeed04694b1df48aa5b599108a041ecca092724d2a4d3f000\",\"question\":\"Will the Democrats win the Illinois Senate race in 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the winner of the 2026 midterm Illinois U.S. Senate election, inclusive of any run-offs.\\n\\nA candidate shall be considered to represent a party in the event that he or she is the nominee of the party in question. Candidates other than the Democratic or Republican nominee (e.g., Greens, Libertarian, independent) may be added at a later date.\\n\\nCandidates who run as independents will not be encompassed by the “Democrat” or “Republican” options regardless of any affiliation they may have with the party.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the Associated Press, Fox News, and NBC. This market will resolve once all three sources call the race for the same candidate. If all three sources haven’t called the race in this state for the same candidate, this market will resolve based on the official certification.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-democrats-win-the-illinois-senate-race-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":null,\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x7146f4aff656226aeed04694b1df48aa5b599108a041ecca092724d2a4d3f000\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0xc81116a803d2fdf5234ec946a2cd8d5e88a75ccf6f3ec598a361ee6dd6717c2e\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.