\"price\":0.86,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\",\"primary elections\",\"Republican Primary\",\"Governor Primary\",\"Minnesota Primary\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-12T23:02:02Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x87de096eafda13dd2b6f759114a65b5397bd75cdf4d91bae9b651cf4e60f1eab\",\"question_id\":\"0x2d70d73ebef033ec76e9027d0f732eb4be61b4f29d859936f12dd450fc1c7ae3\",\"question\":\"Will the 10-year Treasury yield dip below 3.8% before 2027?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to \\\"Yes\\\" if the Treasury 10-year yield is lower than the listed value for any date between November 11, 2025 and December 31, 2026. Otherwise this market will resolve to \\\"No\\\".\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the Department of the treasury, specially the data listed under \\\"Daily Treasury Par Yield Curve Rates\\\" for the column \\\"10 Yr\\\" (see: https://home.treasury.gov/resource-center/data-chart-center/interest-rates/TextView?type=daily_treasury_yield_curve\\u0026field_tdr_date_value=2025).\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-10-year-treasury-yield-dip-below-3pt8-before-2027-914\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-10-year-treasury-yield-dip-below-3pt5-in-2025-vwtsx-rZ8Tge.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-10-year-treasury-yield-dip-below-3pt5-in-2025-vwtsx-rZ8Tge.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"9347111990487733900636918391489984417162545174162283131843493265461066742663\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.47,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"2310208690734501335165541918291506305479166801226183051157995198065529109620\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.53,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Business\",\"Finance\",\"Trump\",\"Fed Rates\",\"Economy\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-10-13T21:42:41Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x44b642636473fb07f0c2319a1d25729a36134969076ffdbb8979cbfdda612b14\",\"question_id\":\"0xffde138416764fdc48d5e1cffa1211069568dda768b468ecb58ec7de75f09f00\",\"question\":\"Will the Democrats win the Minnesota Senate race in 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the winner of the 2026 midterm Minnesota U.S. Senate election, inclusive of any run-offs.\\n\\nA candidate shall be considered to represent a party in the event that he or she is the nominee of the party in question. Candidates other than the Democratic or Republican nominee (e.g., Greens, Libertarian, independent) may be added at a later date.\\n\\nCandidates who run as independents will not be encompassed by the “Democrat” or “Republican” options regardless of any affiliation they may have with the party.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the Associated Press, Fox News, and NBC. This market will resolve once all three sources call the race for the same candidate. If all three sources haven’t called the race in this state for the same candidate, this market will resolve based on the official certification.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-democrats-win-the-minnesota-senate-race-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":null,\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"ne