4BMNx4.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-treg-taylor-win-the-2026-alaska-governor-election-S04nO64BMNx4.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":2}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"93969985011170776056000925561172416309286101442856109696106983204369499012978\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.068,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"72506703256469236704803392095389359754054700969674670489618759577406730106828\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.932,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"US Election\",\"Midterms\",\"Rewards 50, 4.5, 20\",\"Alaska Midterm\",\"Governor midterms\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-05T16:35:07Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0xb51d73fb402680d320b8ae1a1450c17c90eb5c5061d7d406c1f86465276adb60\",\"question_id\":\"0x5e62c6cabdd3af2ee3e670c0ce47c99d620c5270d560c6be3bc826a5226bdc06\",\"question\":\"Will Trump sell 10k-25k Gold Cards in 2026?\",\"description\":\"Donald Trump has announced a “Gold Card” plan to offer a pathway citizenship to citizenship in exchange for a $5m payment.\\n\\nThis market will resolve according to the number of individuals who purchase a “Gold Card” between January 1 and December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET. \\n\\nAny individual participating in a new program created after February 26, 2025, by the Trump Administration which is either referred to as a Gold Card, or involves a new pathway to U.S. citizenship, work permits, or any other form of legal residency status in exchange for payments or investment will qualify. \\n\\nIf the reported value falls exactly between two brackets, then this market will resolve to the higher range bracket.\\n\\nThe resolution source will be official information from the Trump Administration. If the Trump Administration does not publish the number of individuals who receive Gold Cards by December 31, 11:59 PM ET, this market will resolve based on a consensus of credible reporting.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-trump-sell-10k-25k-gold-cards-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":\"2025-12-19T23:40:00Z\",\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x5e62c6cabdd3af2ee3e670c0ce47c99d620c5270d560c6be3bc826a5226bdc00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x2f5131d441db7291ad491b2819deace93c4ec9ed3c408f8875d8e4614df3d35d\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-trump-sell-10k-25k-gold-cards-in-2025-xHI93YnNtFUL.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-trump-sell-10k-25k-gold-cards-in-2025-xHI93YnNtFUL.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":2}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"58858731796442679222989272055454043286056057669744610936854497026401512278651\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.0105,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"5798682250465986989350076675203301795837240505688895325567849193712450372007\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.9895,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Trump\",\"Geopolitics\",\"H-1B\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-19T15:54:15Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x9d48989071ce5b16bac542ed693f589a2fde1950e0a4fc360150f2320059f758\",\"question_id\":\"0x616bf8528bb9ba903fe297432b5e0f9a88a40c287018c36cad59da215703c8aa\",\"question\":\"Kraken IPO closing market cap above $24B?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to “Yes” if the official closing price for Krakens’s market capitalization on its first trading day is above the value specified in the title. Otherwise, it will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nIf no IPO occurs by December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET, this market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nMarket capitalization is defined as the total number of outstanding shares multiplied by the closing share price on the first trading day.\\n\\nResolution will be based on the primary exchange’s official listing page. In the event that the relevant figure is not displayed, another reliable source will be used.\\n\\nIn the event of an interruption in the course of the normal trading session on Kraken’s first day of trading (e.g., a circuit breaker or half-day), the market will resolve according to the official closing price of the abbreviated session. If no such official closing price is published, the market will resolve according to the next trading day on which an official closing price is published, treating that as the first day of trading.\",\"market_slug\":\"kraken-ipo-closing-market-cap-above-24b\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2027-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-kraken-ipo-in-2024--_GT-GzKWtUW.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-kraken-ipo-in-2024--_GT-GzKWtUW.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791bca1f2de4661ed88a30c99a7a9449aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"91027683713979671045745336397477298188194077466070308948719723741690140262890\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.23,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"18240003235560942312006708762837301470345547466622475195901945997863759257424\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.77,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Crypto\",\"IPOs\",\"kraken\",\"Pre-Market\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-02T17:15:12Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xc7bc5d759ecbd05cfbf3b41ec98f1cd7ab306234bf76fd6c1768d3be1d6b9e76\",\"question_id\":\"0x9be11be9c5b901474145a07f8c7ea5e6a117cede7e650bbf94e4b043ad9dc300\",\"question\":\"Will Coalition Avenir Québec win the most seats in the 2026 Quebec general election?\",\"description\":\"Parliamentary elections to elect all 125 seats of the National Assembly of Quebec are scheduled to take place in Quebec on October 5, 2026.\\n\\nThis market will resolve to the political party that wins the greatest number of seats in the National Assembly of Quebec as a result of this election.\\n\\nIf voting in the 2026 Quebec general election does not occur by January 31, 2027, this market will resolve to \\\"Other\\\".\\n\\nIn the event of a tie for the most seats won between this party and any other, this market will resolve in favor of the party that won the most valid votes in the respective election. If this also results in a tie, this market will resolve in favor of the party or coalition whose listed abbreviation comes first in alphabetical order.\\n\\nThis market's resolution will be based solely on the number of seats won by the named party.\\n\\nThis market will resolve based on the result of the election as indicated by a consensus of credible reporting. If there is ambiguity, this market will resolve based solely on the official results as reported by Élections Québec (https://www.electionsquebec.qc.ca).\",\"market_slug\":\"will-coalition-avenir-qubec-win-the-most-seats-in-the-2026-quebec-general-election\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-10-05T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x9be11be9c5b901474145a07f8c7ea5e6a117cede7e650bbf94e4b043ad9dc300\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x37d4177496db6e39cb6217f3aa556ae625bf0701616bb201c71ac039a1f84708\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-coalition-avenir-qubec-win-the-most-seats-in-the-2026-quebec-general-election-1ECuvz-CiqJP.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-coalition-avenir-qubec-win-the-most-seats-in-the-2026-quebec-general-election-1ECuvz-CiqJP.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"62672831099052856773092936123032454032816810006460666476569228483231264400027\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.085,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"97832856862127986027766147933852971526937878635748074587497266036978127808919\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.915,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Canada\",\"Global Elections\",\"World Elections\",\"World\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-13T19:10:40Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0xbe2113835fff9936d39836cf7a27d371df885a74b77659167361b8e847dc788b\",\"question_id\":\"0xf44b0ab469efbf9eedd1b8fb3d1e6b525fe84c22561dca771573eab60e59ab01\",\"question\":\"Will Steve Marshall be the Republican nominee for Senate in Alabama?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the winner of the Republican Primary for United States Senator from Alabama.\\n\\nIf no 2026 Alabama Republican Senate Primary takes place, this market will resolve to \\\"Other\\\".\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be the first announcement of the results from the Alabama Republican party, however an overwhelming consensus of credible reporting may suffice.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-steve-marshall-be-the-republican-nominee-for-senate-in-alabama\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-05-19T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xf44b0ab469efbf9eedd1b8fb3d1e6b525fe84c22561dca771573eab60e59ab00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x6318dcdbc70fe6100907992c690d2cf488bc0712c9e29401c1a3c797940d4369\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/alabama-democratic-senate-primary-winner-5tnx74JjzCuh.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/alabama-democratic-senate-primary-winner-5tnx74JjzCuh.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"108357591179712084089759720919537293699688374447559250225341610071513205224315\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.033,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"52416166036635552680878917775857551204546118028711916498514045945328596559243\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.967,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\",\"primary elections\",\"Republican Primary\",\"Senate Primary\",\"Alabama Primary\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-29T22:54:11Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x908ceb5af95513b2c18969447ec50a0d80328ac593aaee71bea447727383bd60\",\"question_id\":\"0x0ab88b88f39b7f6b63920babe34a6a5c12a5648f29b202ae457f030631e8e71b\",\"question\":\"Will Umar Nurmagomedov become UFC champion in 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to “Yes” if the listed fighter becomes champion of any UFC division between January 1, 2026 and December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nOnly official UFC division champions will count. Interim champions will not count.\\n\\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be official information from the UFC (https://www.ufc.com/athletes); however, a consensus of credible reporting may also be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-umar-nurmagomedov-become-ufc-champion-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/who-will-become-a-ufc-champion-in-2026-VWze2qWnAGJc.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/who-will-become-a-ufc-champion-in-2026-VWze2qWnAGJc.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"72902152958296380897552374878996759017216244993804336719292032204553988151600\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.125,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"8271100949008554120382398860805895726729582938855150724229889652923433093771\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.875,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Sports\",\"UFC\",\"mma\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-05T16:35:11Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0xaca5aedf274be4876eed3441d1cd4c9f5f3908ee2d5dff4c838ba89cd69365d8\",\"question_id\":\"0x5e62c6cabdd3af2ee3e670c0ce47c99d620c5270d560c6be3bc826a5226bdc07\",\"question\":\"Will Trump sell 25k-100k Gold Cards in 2026?\",\"description\":\"Donald Trump has announced a “Gold Card” plan to offer a pathway citizenship to citizenship in exchange for a $5m payment.\\n\\nThis market will resolve according to the number of individuals who purchase a “Gold Card” between January 1 and December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET. \\n\\nAny individual participating in a new program created after February 26, 2025, by the Trump Administration which is either referred to as a Gold Card, or involves a new pathway to U.S. citizenship, work permits, or any other form of legal residency status in exchange for payments or investment will qualify. \\n\\nIf the reported value falls exactly between two brackets, then this market will resolve to the higher range bracket.\\n\\nThe resolution source will be official information from the Trump Administration. If the Trump Administration does not publish the number of individuals who receive Gold Cards by December 31, 11:59 PM ET, this market will resolve based on a consensus of credible reporting.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-trump-sell-25k-100k-gold-cards-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":\"2025-12-19T23:40:00Z\",\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x5e62c6cabdd3af2ee3e670c0ce47c99d620c5270d560c6be3bc826a5226bdc00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x0646a010ca4a401f908121b9ced1339d1d34ea2a07e8557437f22e2c742406b0\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-trump-sell-25k-100k-gold-cards-in-2025-dqrwBGlY2hdg.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-trump-sell-25k-100k-gold-cards-in-2025-dqrwBGlY2hdg.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":3}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"29737896427505913579373080975459102667589461703616780283220419284622020368836\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.036,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"82834542816241625492514061227288286309604590623265497797502039631748808662467\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.964,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Trump\",\"Geopolitics\",\"H-1B\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-09-23T00:22:34Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x3f9f68feccc892303834833665bf204632438b028254fc2d5bceea757ff61ed3\",\"question_id\":\"0xd2c21cbb9d2cb407ab3dcf619d93f6d65b7967154cd6ee930f7758baa2b4bf01\",\"question\":\"Will OpenAI’s market cap be between $500B and $750B at market close on IPO day?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve based on OpenAI's market capitalization at the closing price on its first day of trading.\\n\\nIf no IPO occurs by December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET, the market will resolve to \\\"No IPO by December 31, 2026\\\".\\n\\nMarket capitalization expresses the monetary value of a company’s outstanding shares, stated in its pricing currency. It is calculated as the number of shares outstanding multiplied by the closing share price on the first trading day.\\n\\nIf the relevant value falls exactly between two brackets, then this market will resolve to the higher range bracket.\\n\\nResolution will be based on the primary exchange’s official listing page. In the event that the relevant figure is not displayed, another reliable source will be used.\\n\\nIn the event of an interruption in the course of the normal trading session on OpenAI’s first day of trading (e.g., a circuit breaker or half-day), the market will resolve according to the official closing price of the abbreviated session. If no such official closing price is published, the market will resolve according to the next trading day on which an official closing price is published, treating that as the first day of trading for purposes of this market.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-openais-market-cap-be-between-500b-and-750b-at-market-close-on-ipo-day\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-30T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xd2c21cbb9d2cb407ab3dcf619d93f6d65b7967154cd6ee930f7758baa2b4bf00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0xa3437a11fe5553ee5cc71da95c58be2e8ce85c6a11cdf3403e26ed088fc66bf3\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/openai-ipo-closing-market-cap-RiLs850YpL5k.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/openai-ipo-closing-market-cap-RiLs850YpL5k.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"36088399593046466421453063228085042771351246231742717370399696243183381174466\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.0175,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"11947171408899503371980811142475369274013053223377767646204433492871687017998\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.9825,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Finance\",\"OpenAI\",\"IPOs\",\"Tech\",\"Big Tech\",\"IPO\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2026-01-05T23:36:11Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xe273314ec70ccaa216c30e3ef35c919c6c9ce7afcd05f1925d662bc3685ae3f0\",\"question_id\":\"0xc4db005bf4a42ef926be3b374b10b8609946915cc8502799ffdc3109f3ed80d8\",\"question\":\"Will Los Angeles Thieves finish in the top 4 of the CDL Regular Season?\",\"description\":\"This is a market to predict which teams finish in the top 4 of the Call of Duty League Regular Season standings for the 2025–26 season.\\n\\nIf the listed team officially finishes in the top 4 of the Call of Duty League standings at the end of the season, the market will resolve to \\\"Yes.\\\" Otherwise, it will resolve to \\\"No.\\\"\\n\\nIf two or more teams are tied on points for a top 4 position, resolution will follow the official Call of Duty League tiebreaking procedures.\\n\\nIf the 2025–26 Call of Duty League season is canceled or not completed before October 1, 2026, this market will resolve to \\\"No.\\\"\\n\\nThe primary resolution source will be official information from the Call of Duty League (https://www.callofdutyleague.com/en-us/standings?utm_source=cdlweb\\u0026utm_medium=navigationbar\\u0026utm_campaign=general). A consensus of credible reporting may also be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-los-angeles-thieves-finish-in-the-top-4-of-the-cdl-regular-season\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-28T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/CDL-768575852a.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/CDL-768575852a.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791bca1f2de4661ed88a30c99a7a9449aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"69827386289951697918017134180293880012508844173057245913513625928018114918855\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.5,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"43643985494165799885670606837915694203645372255547098332333725815945760808947\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.5,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Sports\",\"Esports\",\"COD\",\"Call of Duty\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-18T20:48:37Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x5fae5ba9043197e890c32aef1acf277e3ebbc31b643022bef86006b35b3dec5e\",\"question_id\":\"0xfe717f7ff634849479ba70f3b6aa3bd9c6dd7c64a838a2b2b2fd0f9ec08ea7ed\",\"question\":\"Will Antony Barran advance to the general election for WA-03?\",\"description\":\"The non-partisan primary election for the WA-03 congressional district seat in the U.S. House of Representatives is scheduled to take place on August 4, 2026. The two candidates who receive the most votes in this primary election will qualify for the General Election.\\n\\nThis market will resolve to “Yes” If the listed candidate advances from the primary to the general election for the WA-03 congressional district seat in the U.S. House of Representatives. Otherwise this market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nIf no 2026 WA-03 congressional district primary takes place, this market will resolve to “No.”\\n\\nThis market will resolve based on the results of the primary election for the WA-03 congressional district seat, as indicated by a consensus of credible reporting. If there is ambiguity, this market will resolve based solely on the official results as reported by the government of Washington, specifically the Washington Office of the Secretary of State.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-antony-barran-advance-to-the-general-election-for-wa-03\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-08-04T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/wa-03-house-election-winner-yhLDeGZqATqe.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/wa-03-house-election-winner-yhLDeGZqATqe.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"259400365059860451681353127368931497850273380