6-09T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xebf0dee252c9b736aaa6906dbff66c1e90b38bb628c20a70d4fd3da9686ab100\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x4ae04e645cf721aca38b4b7af488076ee25a43bf4376cb59b139d7f18217b535\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/maine-governor-democratic-primary-winner-XTKC1g5Ce2v3.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/maine-governor-democratic-primary-winner-XTKC1g5Ce2v3.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"72338391605515302284510099473300856508667998083626555858194999880535233113656\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.32,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"107835800874964094211160747648432653308546249157994527573832245084098904365672\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.68,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\",\"primary elections\",\"Democratic Primary\",\"Governor Primary\",\"Maine Primary\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2026-01-14T00:53:06Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x5f5cf92636c3644a6221fba15d00e8aab9d539c17a0d25d8ae8d15220cbd2cb9\",\"question_id\":\"0xa8248074a050a753967703fa235147dc324296482db66ddfb3e533366fcc82c1\",\"question\":\"Blue tsunami in 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to “Yes” if both of the following conditions are met as a result of the 2026 midterm elections:\\n\\n- Democrats hold 235 or more seats in the House\\n- Democrats hold 51 or more seats in the Senate\\n\\nOtherwise, this market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nThis market will remain open until it is confirmed that at least one of the above conditions has not been met, or until all of the above conditions have been met.\\n\\nThe full rules for this market can be found here:\\nhttps://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/BlueTsunami.pdf\",\"market_slug\":\"blue-tsunami-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-11-30T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/ts-383309bc1a.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/ts-383309bc1a.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":100,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"104553523523914235759341374025389236788228938851306015279604263702927625849402\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.495,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"41459524264337272546561188587282154510414592209325388586279352627772498337794\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.505,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Congress\",\"US Election\",\"Parlays\",\"Midterms\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-18T20:37:45Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x9ee5565296fbc49e0a2965c48a04c04a80a2cfd966d4eee60504602c63c4e02b\",\"question_id\":\"0xdbbd88ca9c6de2497a80404fca252a4c0005661f2623550a21a9eddddd7e3d4e\",\"question\":\"Will the Fed’s lower bound reach 1.0% or lower before 2027?\",\"description\":\"The FED interest rates are defined in this market by the lower or the upper bound of the target federal funds range. The decisions on the target federal fund range are made by the Federal Open Market Committee (FOMC) meetings.\\n\\nThis market will resolve to “Yes” if the lower or the upper bound of the target federal funds rate reaches the specified level at any point by December 31, 2026, 12:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to “No.”\\n\\nEmergency rate cuts and hikes outside the regularly scheduled meetings will be considered.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the official website of the Federal Reserve at:\\nhttps://www.federalreserve.gov/monetarypolicy/openmarket.htm.\\n\\nThis market may resolve as soon as the relevant data showing the reached level is published.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-feds-lower-bound-reach-1pt0-or-lower-before-2027-913-827-367-957-973-514\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/fed-rate-cut-in-2025-8aDiUiuri3_D.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/fed-rate-cut-in-2025-8aDiUiuri3_D.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"58154647293006580716141871248720424670235954918002758656321872037220737257758\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.073,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"50135182273376738494592908468512341110019005877557465082651031108169932588157\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.927,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Fed\",\"Fed Rates\",\"Economy\",\"Jerome Powell\",\"Economic Policy\",\"Macro Indicators\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-19T02:05:27Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x2fb2b4f6d030ed03404e844400cf763a5dfc70275a3d6bd03770287cd7bced56\",\"question_id\":\"0x055ece9b72fb3c49abe9de60cb0b06050e55b70d5f5c74d03facd7288f817002\",\"question\":\"Will the Republican Party hold exactly 49 Senate seats after the 2026 midterm elections?\",\"description\":\"The 2026 midterm elections are scheduled to be held on November 3, 2026.\\n\\nThis market will resolve according to the number of seats held by the Republican Party in the US Senate as a result of the 2026 midterm elections.\\n\\nThis market will resolve based on the results of all Senate elections, including special elections, that are scheduled to occur in November 2026 as of October 31, 2026. If a required runoff for any such election could change the market’s outcome, the market will remain open until that runoff is conclusively called by this market’s resolution sources.\\n\\nIf a Senate seat is vacant but a corresponding election is not held in November 2026, the seat will be considered held by the party of the seat's most recent incumbent.\\n\\nA candidate's party will be determined by their ballot-listed or otherwise identifiable affiliation with that party at the time all of the 2026 Senate elections are conclusively called by this market's resolution sources. A candidate without a ballot-listed affiliation to either the Democratic or Republican parties will be considered a member of one of these parties based on the party with which they most recently expressed their intent to caucus at the time all of the Senate elections are conclusively called by this market's resolution sources.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the Associated Press, Fox News, and NBC. This market will resolve once all three sources have conclusively called all Senate elections. If all three sources do not achieve consensus in calling the relevant races for this market, it will resolve based on the official certification.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-republican-party-hold-exactly-49-senate-seats-after-the-2026-midterm-elections-189\",\"end_date_iso\":null,\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x055ece9b72fb3c49abe9de60cb0b06050e55b70d5f5c74d03facd7288f817000\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0xdb516c45227833d633a59d08bc0e2827c550153142f3e67753d626c2a4210a1e\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-republicans-lose-a-seat-in-the-us-senate-for-any-state-trump-won-in-2024-36T8qr8R2Va9.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-republicans-lose-a-seat-in-the-us-senate-for-any-state-trump-won-in-2024-36T8qr8R2Va9.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"62377650660175430184575321355603581384424839385693705300992070114964919683845\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.165,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"99655040067292753693448676958121989757561886043736853458079391478756360529457\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.835,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Trump\",\"Elections\",\"United States\",\"Congress\",\"US Election\",\"Midterms\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-04T23:27:01Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x803f919bd0148b6450c264b920fc2bc9a7e8f15b0ae9fe52ff34ab10217df084\",\"question_id\":\"0xcdf20c58d85220ab7c65433411ac733acac6b6948f81f6839aaef30f93992200\",\"question\":\"Will John Kiper win the 2026 New Hampshire Governor Democratic primary election?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the winner of the Democratic Primary for Governor of New Hampshire, scheduled to take place on September 8, 2026. Resolution will be based on the overall winner of the primary, including any potential second round or run-off.\\n\\nIf no 2026 New Hampshire Gubernatorial Democratic Primary takes place, this market will resolve to “Other.”\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be the first official announcement of the results from the New Hampshire Democratic Party; however, an overwhelming consensus of credible reporting may suffice.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-john-kiper-win-the-2026-new-hampshire-governor-democratic-primary-election\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-09-08T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xcdf20c58d85220ab7c65433411ac733acac6b6948f81f6839aaef30f93992200\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x7c5c4753be2b908260a49ada0b29e3a8385b9825de036348033e7abef3f3e621\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/new-hampshire-governor-republican-primary-winner-fuV8qISN3trV.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/new-hampshire-governor-republican-primary-winner-fuV8qISN3trV.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"22831161611260770681179115464104748034107548539557831079982916914834139876654\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.045,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"19417804956492135774150112752914298384650531820726154954365175316625877005276\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.955,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\",\"primary elections\",\"Democratic Primary\",\"New Hampshire Primary\",\"Governor Primary\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2026-01-02T20:35:05Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x81474d7afeab3c4a69fd893fb4938ae513b216d0e2ecc75f6b8e2885db13b4a7\",\"question_id\":\"0x2955e0b0325de182c7db3e9cc278b435a7e6956b599fd0113f5838d756c9e201\",\"question\":\"Will Iga Swiatek win the 2026 Women’s US Open?\",\"description\":\"The 2026 U.S. Open tennis tournament is scheduled for August 23 - September 13, 2026.\\n\\nThis market will resolve to the player that wins the 2026 U.S. Open Women’s Singles Tournament.\\n\\nIf at any point it becomes impossible for a listed player to win the 2026 U.S. Open Women’s Singles Tournament per the rules of the tournament, the corresponding market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nIf the 2026 U.S. Open Women’s Singles Tournament is cancelled, postponed after October 31, 2026, or there is otherwise no winner declared within that timeframe, this market will resolve to “Other”.\\n\\nThe primary resolution source will be official information from the U.S. Open (https://www.usopen.org/index.html); however, a consensus of credible reporting may also be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-iga-swiatek-win-the-2026-womens-us-open\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-09-13T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x2955e0b0325de182c7db3e9cc278b435a7e6956b599fd0113f5838d756c9e200\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x59d414ad36242e0be873554aa630d450260a807a6a729493b3b2d7e2fe3f86ba\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/2026-mens-us-open-winner-tennis-oSTkkDpgQu-b.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/2026-mens-us-open-winner-tennis-oSTkkDpgQu-b.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"43019814168262297205212875746536428496562492484909868859351235533088849593883\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.115,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"63121398982749572286119195691751068463674406856603972408298899143876860265927\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.885,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Sports\",\"Tennis\",\"WTA\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-24T19:54:33Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x11f8f845d4965a4a7418c57272c92ba23242f12faef555bc79eeebf5416eeea1\",\"question_id\":\"0x925653ca47f01fe95951f817e05c2038cdc07c4578aa79ded46f23337803e64f\",\"question\":\"Will XRP reach $5.00 by December 31, 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will immediately resolve to “Yes” if any Binance 1-minute candle for XRP (XRP/USDT) between November 24, 2025, 14:30 and December 31, 2026, 23:59 in the ET timezone has a final “High” price equal to or greater than the price specified in the title. Otherwise, this market will resolve to “No.”\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is Binance, specifically the XRP/USDT “High” prices available at:\\nhttps://www.binance.com/en/trade/XRP_USDT with the chart set to “1m” (one-minute candles) on the top bar.\\n\\nPlease note that the outcome of this market depends solely on the price data from the Binance XRP/USDT trading pair. Prices from other exchanges, different trading pairs, or spot markets will not be considered for the resolution of this market.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-xrp-reach-5pt00-by-december-31-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2027-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/XRP-logo.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/XRP-logo.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791bca1f2de4661ed88a30c99a7a9449aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"49298809552663577090953558115623306552793446323919551228841438478206311771334\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.07,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"98356009591729059104867383694921691652999524426205630246165877167563623571748\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.93,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Crypto\",\"Crypto Prices\",\"XRP\",\"Hit Price\",\"Yearly\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-10T21:12:26Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x24853c19d734365752c0080d4c571619d025f51bb87f6a5b0571c1af28d070fc\",\"question_id\":\"0x12030c3720dd973cbf5022b04b12911926e96d0e47894d9569160c533088f264\",\"question\":\"Will Matt Heilala advance from the 2026 Alaska Governor primary election?\",\"description\":\"The non-partisan primary election for Governor of Alaska is scheduled to take place on August 18, 2026. The top four candidates in this election by number of votes won will advance to the general election for Governor of Alaska.\\n\\nThis market will resolve to “Yes” If the listed candidate advances from the primary to the general election for Governor of Alaska. Otherwise this market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nIf no 2026 Alaska gubernatorial primary takes place, this market will resolve to “No.”\\n\\nThis market will resolve based on the results of the primary election for Governor of Alaska as indicated by a consensus of credible reporting. If there is ambiguity, this market will resolve based solely on the official results as reported by the government of Alaska, specifically the State of Alaska Division of Elections.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-matt-heilala-advance-from-the-2026-alaska-governor-primary-election\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-08-18T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/who-will-advance-from-the-alaska-governor-primary-7EPybqNOA6-J.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/who-will-advance-from-the-alaska-governor-primary-7EPybqNOA6-J.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"90324830449316021518799349765262130438676787265386776791637227837421872309149\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.125,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"712233245840692314040077845479889645012074788682808624898143837312715690170\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.875,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-10-13T21:33:01Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xa0af1b2ca6a3251cad3845f8172febb2182cd7a60744cc9cb685c626e595d0da\",\"question_id\":\"0xd8ffa0dc386b43092dc7bcdc5361ad28518276989bf88ee50643edca2fb2d400\",\"question\":\"Will the Democrats win the Tennessee Senate race in 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the winner of the 2026 midterm Tennessee U.S. Senate election, inclusive of any run-offs.\\n\\nA candidate shall be considered to represent a party in the event that he or she is the nominee of the party in question. Candidates other than the Democratic or Republican nominee (e.g., Greens, Libertarian, independent) may be added at a later date.\\n\\nCandidates who run as independents will not be encompassed by the “Democrat” or “Republican” options regardless of any affiliation they may have with the party.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the Associated Press, Fox News, and NBC. This market will resolve once all three sources call the race for the same candidate. If all three sources haven’t called the race in this state for the same candidate, this market will resolve based on the official certification.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-democrats-win-the-tennessee-senate-race-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":null,\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xd8ffa0dc386b43092dc7bcdc5361ad28518276989bf88ee50643edca2fb2d400\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x26c25341099dd95c8a43cc5e2ab26686835087c4164a9c325cb71351219245c4\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-democratic-party-control-the-senate-after-the-2026-midterm-elections-JJ9h02JGR09z.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-democratic-party-control-the-senate-after-the-2026-midterm-elections-JJ9h02JGR09z.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"109770398277480657132311708823042764648778271467537669934185093015733099277755\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.05,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"50635500573145079077706052236022272447121646566197183315877718515529765028366\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.95,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"US Election\",\"Midterms\",\"Tennessee Midterm\",\"Senate midterms\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-19T23:53:41Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x3ec9449039bbce89a67846390a7f1252bc43cbc0d0496db66c248bf0d78639fa\",\"question_id\":\"0x7e79bbb58525e6488e984721afbc9e527c6c4d5fd8df69cf73bbb3c17a909435\",\"question\":\"Will Wes Moore announce a Presidential run before 2027?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to “Yes” if the listed individual officially announces that they are running for U.S. President in the 2028 United States presidential election by December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nAn announcement by the listed individual  will be sufficient to trigger a \\\"Yes\\\" resolution, regardless of whether they actually filed a nomination to run, or whether they actually file a nomination to run in the future.\\n\\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be official statements by the listed individual (ex: via speech, social media, etc.), however a consensus of credible reporting may also be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-wes-moore-announce-a-presidential-run-before-2027\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-wes-moore-win-the-2028-us-presidential-election-XPjvhtcLdoZV.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-wes-moore-win-the-2028-us-presidential-election-XPjvhtcLdoZV.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"112393989023250176814680066380110594891242242518527762105666760152448041311098\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.13,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"34200455719157926482842336744225424772828556907793436823619465682346888710678\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.87,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Celebrities\",\"President\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-09T18:47:32Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xb1dd35e85b6a712dbd1049c0bd4e7637d7bfea7e1020a12d761732418a279d37\",\"question_id\":\"0xb85e3162753fb38ea5deae7384f5deabe444e9f3a3c69dd27a1635dbe0ccbf02\",\"question\":\"Will ACA premium tax credits not be extended and will the Democratic Party win the House in 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the combined outcome of whether enhanced ACA premium tax credits will be extended in 2025 (https://polymarket.com/event/enhanced-aca-premium-tax-credits-extended-in-2025?) and according to which party will win the House in 2026 (https://polymarket.com/event/which-party-will-win-the-house-in-2026?).\\n\\nThe rules and resolution criteria are as follows:\\n\\n1. Enhanced ACA premium tax credits extended in 2025?\\nAffordable Care Act (ACA) enhanced premium tax credits are set to expire at the end of 2025 if not extended by the federal government.\\n\\nThis market will resolve according to whether a bill extending the enhanced ACA premium tax credits beyond 2025 is signed into federal law by December 31, 2025, 11:59 PM ET. \\n\\nA qualifying bill may extend the enhanced ACA premium tax credits in any form, including shorter extensions, phased-down benefits, or narrowed eligibility, as long as the bill clearly continues enhanced premium tax credits that have wider eligibility and/or lower required income contributions relative to baseline ACA premium tax credits that would otherwise apply after 2025.\\n\\nA bill replacing the ACA enhanced premium tax credits with an alternative form of healthcare subsidy, such as direct cash payments to a health savings account, will not qualify.\\n\\nIf the bill is signed into law before 2026, it will qualify to resolve this market, regardless of when it takes effect.\\n\\nThe primary source of resolution will be official information from the US federal government; however, a consensus of credible reporting may also be used.\\n\\n2. Which party will win the House in 2026?\\nThis market will resolve according to the party that controls the House of Representatives following the 2026 U.S. House elections scheduled for November 3, 2026.\\n\\nHouse control is defined as having more than half of the voting members of the U.S. House of Representatives.\\n\\nIf the outcome of this election is ambiguous given the above rules, this market will remain open until the Speaker of the House is selected following the 2026 U.S. general election, at which point it will resolve to the party the Speaker is affiliated with at the time of their election to that position. If the elected Speaker does not caucus with any listed party this market will resolve “Other”.\\n\\nDetermination of which party controls the House after the 2026 U.S. House elections will be based on a consensus of credible reporting, or if there is ambiguity, final federal and/or state election authority certification or other final official determination of the 2026 election results.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-aca-premium-tax-credits-not-be-extended-and-will-the-democratic-party-win-the-house-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-11-03T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xb85e3162753fb38ea5deae7384f5deabe444e9f3a3c69dd27a1635dbe0ccbf00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x1e08f5808ebe1e051c16c97651f0f41eed509f47b1f72758643131814e658ec3\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/which-party-will-win-the-house-in-2026-lO2ezdY5lP2i.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/which-party-will-win-the-house-in-2026-lO2ezdY5lP2i.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":2}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"86645756284795141132717911088354383841969587463930039724769631564209585656220\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.835,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"100728648643824331517551299729912114537167401103552759417052764717048551539704\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.165,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Trump\",\"Elections\",\"United States\",\"Congress\",\"US Election\",\"Global Elections\",\"Midterms\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-04T23:27:01Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x0d63d3c455553636e58b3a9f5668cab1886d5ded01f126779bcf822820ced174\",\"question_id\":\"0xcdf20c58d85220ab7c65433411ac733acac6b6948f81f6839aaef30f93992202\",\"question\":\"Will Deaglan McEachern win the 2026 New Hampshire Governor Democratic primary election?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the winner of the Democratic Primary for Governor of New Hampshire, scheduled to take place on September 8, 2026. Resolution will be based on the overall winner of the primary, including any potential second round or run-off.\\n\\nIf no 2026 New Hampshire Gubernatorial Democratic Primary takes place, this market will resolve to “Other.”\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be the first official announcement of the results from the New Hampshire Democratic Party; however, an overwhelming consensus of credible reporting may suffice.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-deaglan-mceachern-win-the-2026-new-hampshire-governor-democratic-primary-election\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-09-08T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,