ment, as reflected in Yahoo Finance's 1-minute interval (\\\"1m\\\") data, will be considered.\\n\\nPeriods when the market is officially closed (e.g., holidays or maintenance breaks) will not be considered.\\n\\nAll times referenced are local to the primary exchange on which the index trades.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is Yahoo Finance — specifically, the 1-minute interval (\\\"1m\\\") chart data for S\\u0026P 500 (SPX) available at https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EGSPC/.\",\"market_slug\":\"spx-hit-8000-high-jun-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-30T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/s-and-p-500-1e40af6979.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/s-and-p-500-1e40af6979.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791bca1f2de4661ed88a30c99a7a9449aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"66782983377875541581922324583179093507726801029702229798354410000241823417691\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.031,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"27816647960503683598192093691644832449583634736083554885359948851535525968944\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.969,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Finance\",\"Monthly\",\"Indicies\",\"SPX\",\"S\\u0026P 500\",\"S\\u0026P\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-08-22T02:20:59Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0xa8e2f123b6001c0f63d2bafa4f654acd1500a413b2e12110686b90c393c49da0\",\"question_id\":\"0x127d57a48ee888670e4f714f7b9d02e7ce4a56761447adb7c711725125b0e38a\",\"question\":\"Will Napoli finish in the top 4 in the 2025-26 Serie A season?\",\"description\":\"This is a polymarket to predict which clubs finish in the top 4 of the Serie A standings for the 2025-26 season.\\n\\nIf the listed club officially finishes in the top 4 of the Serie A standings at the end of the season, the market will resolve to \\\"Yes\\\". Otherwise, it will resolve to \\\"No\\\".\\n\\nIf two or more clubs are tied on points for a top 4 position, resolution will follow the official Serie A tiebreaking procedures.\\n\\nIf the 2025-26 Serie A season is cancelled or not completed before October 1, 2026, this market will resolve to \\\"No\\\".\\n\\nThe primary resolution source will be official information from Serie A soccer. A consensus of credible reporting may also be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-napoli-finish-in-the-top-4-in-the-2025-26-serie-a-season\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-05-28T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"0x1fAeaAD5B1CBDf4595682D6350F353B9Da5a1f75\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/serie-a-league-winner--p-sBJv4AsiH.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/serie-a-league-winner--p-sBJv4AsiH.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"102301849623335609730031008739036219105375069576896430721113512919948604973345\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.977,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"25060578081367096112903646557925801777089515837363144917297770742253452709049\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.023,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Sports\",\"Soccer\",\"Serie A\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-10-13T23:26:53Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x86ffa053e9aae00a47623b4806e35805df241e6ad28328727f01d29aadd4fe4f\",\"question_id\":\"0xb5ba431e070b41bf5b9619c3e325d2892646c645dd026933e56d53649dfe2500\",\"question\":\"Will the Democrats win the Connecticut governor race in 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the winner of the 2026 Connecticut gubernatorial election.\\n\\nA candidate shall be considered to represent a party in the event that he or she is the nominee of the party in question. Candidates other than the Democratic or Republican nominee (e.g., Greens, Libertarian, independent) may be added at a later date.\\n\\nCandidates who run as independents will not be encompassed by the “Democrat” or “Republican” options regardless of any affiliation they may have with the party.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the Associated Press, Fox News, and NBC. This market will resolve once all three sources call the race for the same candidate. If all three sources haven’t called the race in this state for the same candidate, this market will resolve based on the official certification.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-democrats-win-the-connecticut-governor-race-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":null,\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xb5ba431e070b41bf5b9619c3e325d2892646c645dd026933e56d53649dfe2500\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x39425519b66ee9335845b5af4732080687dc4f13c4e15c711b4cedd3413de4a2\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-democratic-party-control-the-senate-after-the-2026-midterm-elections-JJ9h02JGR09z.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-democratic-party-control-the-senate-after-the-2026-midterm-elections-JJ9h02JGR09z.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":100,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"94716743709853585469973889676994451123824166409123282527490222914006156870020\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.935,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"79903668476273078904167389486657973102725695126491520283526754047409624544734\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.065,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"US Election\",\"Midterms\",\"Connecticut Midterm\",\"Governor midterms\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2026-01-02T18:54:29Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xf7cb64502151bde17648b90f53abc3e5338b4193d14a636e225dffcb245b5c16\",\"question_id\":\"0x2dc3b62f4ebdc1b92b388846626da3e0a5775a9140571dea9e5f05c7ea125c8e\",\"question\":\"Will US unemployment reach at least 5.0% in 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to “Yes” if any seasonally adjusted unemployment rate (total unemployed, as a percent of the civilian labor force, official unemployment rate denoted as U-3) reported by the Bureau of Labor Statistics in an “Employment Situation Report” for a reference month in 2026 is greater than or equal to the listed percentage. Otherwise, this market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nThe relevant reports for this market are the Employment Situation Reports for January-December, 2026. This market may not resolve to “No” until the Employment Situation report for December 2026 is released. If no Employment Situation Report for December 2026 is released by March 31, 2027, 11:59 PM ET, however, this market will resolve based on all previously published data up to that time. \\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the Monthly Employment Situation Report, published by the BLS every month at https://www.bls.gov/bls/news-release/empsit.htm, specifically the U-3 measure in Table A-15 for each month.\\n\\nNote: the resolution source for this market reports unemployment to one decimal point. Thus, this is the level of precision that will be used when resolving the market.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-us-unemployment-reach-at-least-5pt0-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-01-10T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/march-unemployment-rate-wpcB-Q7lTi_r.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/march-unemployment-rate-wpcB-Q7lTi_r.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":5}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"108683340244272797423903928139400863604636305580987691842877673995933500284505\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.385,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"31610604163245612527039147654126910320994564874113102346338822825545391109073\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.615,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"unemployment\",\"Economy\",\"bls\",\"Macro Indicators\",\"NFP\",\"nonfarm payroll\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2026-01-22T00:27:30Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0xc97f915b033f2176eb9f62dc9d184899e51f4803bc2bb23b20e4fb85e6c41912\",\"question_id\":\"0xc0907531709bfa9be6679054e11ab9b15f4fe58b54a84a4ea12f64760b6c7d01\",\"question\":\"Will the Eurozone's 2026 Annual Inflation be between 1.0% and 1.2%?\",\"description\":\"This is a market about the variation of consumer prices in the Eurozone over the 12-month period ending December 2026 as reported by Eurostat.\\n\\nThis market will resolve according to the percentage change in the Harmonised Index of Consumer Prices (HICP) over the 12-month period ending December 2026, according to the monthly Eurostat report.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be the Eurostat Harmonised Index of Consumer Prices monthly report released for December 2026, currently scheduled to be released on January 19, 2027. Resolution of this market will take place upon release of the aforementioned data. If no data for the specified month is released by the date the next month's data is scheduled to be released, this market will resolve based on data from the last available month.\\n\\nYou can find this report on the Eurostat website (https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/en/) by selecting the \\\"Database\\\" option from the \\\"Data\\\" dropdown, opening the \\\"Data navigation tree\\\" folder, then the \\\"Economy and finance\\\" folder, then the \\\"Prices (prc)\\\" folder, then the \\\"Harmonised index of consumer prices (HICP) (prc_hicp)\\\" folder, and opening the file named \\\"HICP - monthly data (annual rate of change) (prc_hicp_manr)\\\". The relevant figure can be found in the column for the relevant month in the row marked \\\"Euro area - 20 countries (from 2023)\\\".\\n\\nNote: the resolution source for this market will be the official monthly Eurostat HICP news release which reports inflation change over 12-month periods to only one decimal point (e.g. 1.9%). Thus, this is the level of precision that will be used when resolving the market. For the full release schedule, see: https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/main/news/release-calendar or https://www.ecb.europa.eu/press/calendars/statscal/ges/html/sthicp.en.html\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-eurozones-2026-annual-inflation-be-between-1pt0-and-1pt2\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2027-01-19T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xc0907531709bfa9be6679054e11ab9b15f4fe58b54a84a4ea12f64760b6c7d00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x71869acb775e7be738e94c9f8f9caac76928e9e755303b610ebf256acd81108b\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/november-inflation-eu-monthly-zliDSBBeyriL.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/november-inflation-eu-monthly-zliDSBBeyriL.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":5.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"8719012220068962210130233884086704157996054029369785876088585541936043361084\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.051,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"55152275662371614827112357032195664648710333341444911183230058635699786866747\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.949,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Inflation\",\"eu\",\"Economy\",\"Europe\",\"cpi\",\"Macro Indicators\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-19T23:53:31Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x3ea2f7cef17dcf428183678588bf2d0b8357003bed0b0f6e5f416605667b64cd\",\"question_id\":\"0xa7b19680f77afcc5d646d31e59bbdd1fe9052555315b331c9d1a256272e32973\",\"question\":\"Will Beto O’Rourke announce a Presidential run before 2027?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to “Yes” if the listed individual announces that they are running for President in the 2028 United States presidential election by December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nAn announcement by the listed individual  will be sufficient to trigger a \\\"Yes\\\" resolution, regardless of whether they actually filed a nomination to run, or whether they actually file a nomination to run in the future.\\n\\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be official statements by the listed individual (ex: via speech, social media, etc.), however a consensus of credible reporting may also be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-beto-orourke-announce-a-presidential-run-before-2027\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/beto+o'rourke.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/beto+o'rourke.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"5755180689316893647533659660162306186200096413006140525344416293875490946686\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.1355,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"53872232912459308406302730613552827607086208264896825573905566328368410714915\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.8645,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Celebrities\",\"President\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-18T20:36:31Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0xd4b9577d5640c162bc058907b44b36741d8fe4d10fcf4bbc977b096ca90519f3\",\"question_id\":\"0x2074e3921433df77940b4f594ce224f2ae012a9a68aa353d5497bda8da0bef01\",\"question\":\"Will James Clark be the Republican Nominee for ME-02?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the candidate who wins the nomination for the Republican Party to contest the ME-02 congressional district seat in the U.S. House of Representatives in the 2026 midterm elections. The Republican primary will take place on June 9, 2026.\\n\\nIf no nominee is announced by November 3, 2026, 11:59PM ET, this market will resolve to \\\"Other\\\".\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be a consensus of official Republican sources, including https://www.rnc.org/.\\n\\nAny replacement of the nominee before election day will not change the resolution of the market.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-james-clark-be-the-republican-nominee-for-me-02\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-09T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x2074e3921433df77940b4f594ce224f2ae012a9a68aa353d5497bda8da0bef00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x2539ffa6dd9eeb075fd4b45f5e0e358ec3b1773cb8e3e6d2c27a08393ca14fd3\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/me-02-house-election-winner-p9BgVhcR2Tei.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/me-02-house-election-winner-p9BgVhcR2Tei.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"64284753300193161656738631436785153867819025210552262036758897931331151987575\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.043,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"41690494021377756676557234430418678018467661140414844385723681656498371796949\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.957,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\",\"primary elections\",\"Republican Primary\",\"House Primary\",\"Maine Primary\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-24T22:03:17Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xd958b067595515de5ee895698870c5975987ddde0bf4ce1a9d6e498462ce363f\",\"question_id\":\"0xc1e56270c58146e35666967141daf73af9a430f0fe2108c96e5487698c875a55\",\"question\":\"Will Pump.fun reach $0.0090 by December 31, 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will immediately resolve to “Yes” if any Binance 1-minute candle for Pump.fun (PUMP/USDT) between November 24, 2025, 17:00 and December 31, 2026, 23:59 in the ET timezone has a final “High” price equal to or greater than the price specified in the title. Otherwise, this market will resolve to “No.”\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is Binance, specifically the PUMP/USDT “High” prices available at:\\nhttps://www.binance.com/en/trade/PUMP_USDT\\nwith the chart set to “1m” (one-minute candles) on the top bar.\\n\\nPlease note that the outcome of this market depends solely on the price data from the Binance PUMP/USDT trading pair. Prices from other exchanges, different trading pairs, or spot markets will not be considered for the resolution of this market.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-pumpfun-reach-0pt0090-by-december-31-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2027-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/pumpfun-launch-a-token-by-RzTi7_aC42Qa.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/pumpfun-launch-a-token-by-RzTi7_aC42Qa.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"71450523344457251224761262628854626905069444500644315801658544775715308828437\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.07,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"105901854841463856083431103441818656593442521244647744529920313600240776240074\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.93,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Crypto\",\"Crypto Prices\",\"Pump.Fun\",\"Hit Price\",\"Yearly\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-10-13T22:28:53Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0xf27ea17046f54cfa5e7dda5c58f06a3f391f3ae6a3cfaddcda8c432c5afcf2dd\",\"question_id\":\"0x12dddaa9289c6ba9edea65186a32aa9fd1b3154f511f9cae19c46249e3495e00\",\"question\":\"Will the Democrats win the Kentucky Senate race in 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the winner of the 2026 midterm Kentucky U.S. Senate election, inclusive of any run-offs.\\n\\nA candidate shall be considered to represent a party in the event that he or she is the nominee of the party in question. Candidates other than the Democratic or Republican nominee (e.g., Greens, Libertarian, independent) may be added at a later date.\\n\\nCandidates who run as independents will not be encompassed by the “Democrat” or “Republican” options regardless of any affiliation they may have with the party.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the Associated Press, Fox News, and NBC. This market will resolve once all three sources call the race for the same candidate. If all three sources haven’t called the race in this state for the same candidate, this market will resolve based on the official certification.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-democrats-win-the-kentucky-senate-race-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":null,\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x12dddaa9289c6ba9edea65186a32aa9fd1b3154f511f9cae19c46249e3495e00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x8397a6f7312706cd1932ee37dd27344bc0771a77acf9d63bf338c896b8370044\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-democratic-party-control-the-senate-after-the-2026-midterm-elections-JJ9h02JGR09z.png\",\"image\":\