itive resolution.\\n\\nThe primary resolution source for this information will be official information from government of the United States of America, official information from Trump or released by his verified social media accounts (e.g. https://twitter.com/POTUS), however, a consensus of credible reporting will also be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-donald-trump-visit-north-korea-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-donald-trump-visit-north-korea-in-2026-VmZDlZJ9BGnp.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-donald-trump-visit-north-korea-in-2026-VmZDlZJ9BGnp.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"6709119717652562374225616068111125137490249016879278413593272223264509184294\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.115,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"75361281009412003705798542073244986821817189389062239156613712571298443923700\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.885,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Trump\",\"Geopolitics\",\"Foreign Policy\",\"World\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-19T23:53:35Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xe5f107b4f7564523acef1be9fee88ae54769b14a9276bf3d6d095455a89d5fac\",\"question_id\":\"0x8134e3e6de13b13c6b8afdd946b9433334f756361fbbc29030063be044a84062\",\"question\":\"Will Sarah Huckabee Sanders announce a presidential run before 2027?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve t