ce for this market is the Associated Press, Fox News, and NBC. This market will resolve once all three sources call the race for the same candidate. If all three sources haven’t called the race in this state for the same candidate, this market will resolve based on the official certification.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-democrats-win-the-texas-governor-race-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":null,\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x195e8f642b0735fb05cfad8a7e5825dd80a447071b2dd6b3b55861c8243b9900\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0xe803b61bf19f5e26021b98df750bb8e0dee289882d6c6635870d93db76603d0a\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-democratic-party-control-the-senate-after-the-2026-midterm-elections-JJ9h02JGR09z.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-democratic-party-control-the-senate-after-the-2026-midterm-elections-JJ9h02JGR09z.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":100,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"48232987449750988261789196083999659380058157021032932634331257492238853387252\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.145,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"72484470323457781490418074887818414956328925259630173408815876344351328006429\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.855,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"US Election\",\"Midterms\",\"Texas Midterm\",\"Governor midterms\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-11T17:08:37Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0xf411b549a0f6dbdd7cf1386adca51ea2043674fbf6b18a9137787e7ebb3e2146\",\"question_id\":\"0xa386812bcfd748ddf1a3939e739337649245cce07634399c4e1813e948f6dbdf\",\"question\":\"StandX FDV above $3B one day after launch?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to \\\"Yes\\\" if the Fully Diluted Valuation of StandX's token is greater than the value specified in the title 1 day after launch. Otherwise, the market will resolve to \\\"No.\\\"\\n\\nThe token must be actively, publicly transferable and tradable to be considered a launch.\\n\\n\\\"1 day after launch\\\" is defined as 4:00 PM ET on the calendar day following launch. The resolution source for this market is the most liquid price source available. If StandX (https://x.com/StandX_Official) doesn't launch a token by December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET, this market will resolve to \\\"No\\\".\",\"market_slug\":\"standx-fdv-above-3b-one-day-after-launch-573-228-889-488-762\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2027-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-standx-launch-a-token-in-2025-XZgR89YnRKtF.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-standx-launch-a-token-in-2025-XZgR89YnRKtF.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"20265140889081186440001276801030712703463995633847558411246113688048412640821\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.0385,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"101328993232699978160973014215836518343614430937384550974567536142114439913022\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.9615,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Crypto\",\"FDV\",\"Pre-Market\",\"StandX\",\"Token Sales\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":tru