if the specified number of cuts becomes impossible — i.e., if more cuts have already occurred than the strike in question.\\n\\nNote that cuts between 1–24 bps (inclusive) will also be considered 1 rate cut.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be FOMC statements after meetings scheduled in 2026 according to the official calendar: https://www.federalreserve.gov/monetarypolicy/fomccalendars.htm. The level and change of the target federal funds rate is also published at the official website of the Federal Reserve at https://www.federalreserve.gov/monetarypolicy/openmarket.htm.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-2-fed-rate-cuts-happen-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xdcd7daabcacdc4ecf4f9a48d0a2708b52f356dd086c8070992136da62eb72b00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x37bcc68ea10eb0bae375235975972e9651d2df036f3fad88f1c7593d86c50586\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/how-many-fed-rate-cuts-in-2025-9qstZkSL1dn0.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/how-many-fed-rate-cuts-in-2025-9qstZkSL1dn0.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":17}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"72535544017897924722695722172278828562733090748474862987195303914909938482758\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.115,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"81407142104509110921187520775072626840789848613047331773172953370174825669358\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.885,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Business\",\"Finance\",\"Fed\",\"Fed Rates\",\"Economy\",\"Jerome Powell\",\"Economic Policy\",\"Rewards 200, 4.5, 50\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,