\\" price equal to or above the listed price. Otherwise, this market will resolve to \\\"No.\\\"\\n\\nAll prices recorded during regular trading hours of the primary exchange for the instrument, as reflected in Yahoo Finance's 1-minute interval (\\\"1m\\\") data, will be considered.\\n\\nPeriods when the market is officially closed (e.g., holidays or maintenance breaks) will not be considered.\\n\\nAll times referenced are local to the primary exchange on which the index trades.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is Yahoo Finance — specifically, the 1-minute interval (\\\"1m\\\") chart data for S\\u0026P 500 (SPX) available at https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EGSPC/.\",\"market_slug\":\"spx-hit-9300-high-dec-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/s-and-p-500-1e40af6979.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/s-and-p-500-1e40af6979.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791bca1f2de4661ed88a30c99a7a9449aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"12879182838615001977657942721005710639239286820034954788519954050861040463689\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.0465,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"105059771114115326573919006409809016935353420442719758833116881252886852940937\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.9535,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Finance\",\"Monthly\",\"Hide From New\",\"Monthly Hit\",\"Indicies\",\"SPX\",\"S\\u0026P 500\",\"S\\u0026P\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-04T23:19:39Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x583a505658647660175c2e0aa70b4a460d8c34a6b3f46251ce5f9f46e9886c50\",\"question_id\":\"0xae2b3c52d4bffeb584cbc881759fb72151d95934fefd88625d1d0facb84d4de5\",\"question\":\"Will Steve Hilton advance from the 2026 California Governor primary election?\",\"description\":\"The non-partisan primary election for Governor of California is scheduled to take place on June 2, 2026. The top two candidates in this election by number of votes won will advance to the general election for Governor of California.\\n\\nThis market will resolve to “Yes” If the listed candidate advances from the primary to the general election for Governor of California. Otherwise this market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nIf no 2026 California gubernatorial primary takes place by December 31, 2026, this market will resolve to “No.”\\n\\nThis market will resolve based on the results of the primary election for Governor of California as indicated by a consensus of credible reporting. If there is ambiguity, this market will resolve based solely on the official results as reported by the government of California, specifically the Office of the Secretary of State.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-steve-hilton-get-the-first-or-second-most-votes-in-the-2026-california-governor-primary-election\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-02T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/california-governor-election-2026-4b5HcLPNupez.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/california-governor-election-2026-4b5HcLPNupez.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"10844956