 \\\"No\\\".\\n\\nAn announcement by the specified date of their intention to divorce will be sufficient for a \\\"Yes\\\" resolution, regardless of whether the divorce later actually occurs, or whether the actual divorce occurs outside of the timeframe of this market.\\n\\nThe resolution source will be statements from Bill Clinton and/or Hillary Clinton, and their representatives, however a definitive consensus of credible media reporting may be considered.\",\"market_slug\":\"bill-clinton-divorce-by-june-30\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-30T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":0,\"taker_base_fee\":0,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/bill-clinton-divorce-by-june-30-2bvY8TOrilIi.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/bill-clinton-divorce-by-june-30-2bvY8TOrilIi.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"51215099240906444332845543637844003484972219591326150507538792559604103405767\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.021,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"9221900129812865841799147650416903283907634890654319308460062959877554658111\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.979,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Trump\",\"Culture\",\"Epstein\",\"Geopolitics\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-16T18:13:15Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x0810d7953936fe5717540e0e798c95f301bb24ce0a4f0f124348f91a9448c813\",\"question_id\":\"0x6a280e63ee2f870d031cb98252c00128612110e271ee6a761384be20dad9fe00\",\"question\":\"Will the Republican Party win the OH-01 House seat?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the party of the candidate who wins the OH-01 congressional district seat in the U.S. House of Representatives in the 2026 midterm elections. The midterm elections will take place on November 4, 2026.\\n\\n​​A candidate's party will be determined by their ballot-listed or otherwise identifiable affiliation with that party at the time all of the 2026 House elections are conclusively called by this market's resolution sources. A candidate without a ballot-listed affiliation to either the Democrat or Republican parties will be considered a member of one of these parties based on the party with which they most recently expressed their intent to caucus at the time all of the House elections are conclusively called by this market's resolution sources.\\n\\nThis market will resolve based on the result of the election as indicated by a consensus of credible reporting. If there is ambiguity, this market will resolve based solely on the official results as reported by the United States government, specifically the Federal Election Commission (https://www.fec.gov/).\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-republican-party-win-the-oh-01-house-seat\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-11-04T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x6a280e63ee2f870d031cb98252c00128612110e271ee6a761384be20dad9fe00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x5c551b11616b34652971c2f1d02216fd0dc26210ce51b952c87e953481882290\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-republican-party-win-the-ca-22-house-seat-CRZCXAbhDP-H.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-republican-party-win-the-ca-22-house-seat-CRZCXAbhDP-H.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\