"Other\\\".\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be a consensus of official Democrat sources, including https://democrats.org/.\\n\\nAny replacement of the nominee before election day will not change the resolution of the market.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-chris-rabb-be-the-democratic-nominee-for-pa-03\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-05-19T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xaba9323c65ba4150511c087158813190ad66049c68b30c581671c664b3dc8500\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0xb58296039daeb7255280d76da7e78848a556e38f9d16338f45dac256b97fffeb\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/pa-03-democratic-primary-winner-3x1fJMVfQICs.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/pa-03-democratic-primary-winner-3x1fJMVfQICs.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"82783150908575653330387039090262277935846457935962170115543031554220486813721\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.3505,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"78881100420158641019789021549278911311724050594806127703734758418215779873578\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.6495,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\",\"primary elections\",\"Democratic Primary\",\"House Primary\",\"Pennsylvania Primary\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-09-14T21:21:14Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0xda5c517dd5b78c80dec8ceb08ca4f466317633487827d7290332b4851cc4a4fa\",\"question_id\":\"0xadaa1a42dd3cfc0037b06a4cee903c3937092015864dde0a60c1133800c21b94\",\"question\":\"Macron out by June 30, 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to \\\"Yes\\\" if Emmanuel Macron ceases to be President of France for any length of time between September 14, 2025, and June 30, 2026, 11:59 PM ET (inclusive). Otherwise, this market will resolve to \\\"No\\\".\\n\\nIf Macron departs from office before the expiry date, the market should resolve immediately.\\n\\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be information from the government of France, however a consensus of credible reporting will also be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"macron-out-by-june-30-2026-273\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-30T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/macron-out-in-2025-834-KqEqAsR_3Rtg.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/macron-out-in-2025-834-KqEqAsR_3Rtg.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":2}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"16201530957950630406397949502319734794139620443510795733205872225099141120819\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.0135,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"22488814055465212843401871684243737932656687199587127613893702721105723939237\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.9865,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"France\",\"resign\",\"2025 Predictions\",\"Macron\",\"World\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-19T22:51:09Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x8e7a03cb1970e2ad6533b01892403516b6b3f5b5fa90ed7d104c28b27e40ba00\",\"question_id\":\"0x83f73856c2c2982dd3f3aba8a7d1e3f494d1b76919b725dc51aceefa82218162\",\"question\":\"MicroStrategy sells any Bitcoin by June 30, 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to \\\"Yes\\\" if MicroStrategy sells any of its Bitcoin by 11:59 PM ET on the date specified in the title. Otherwise, this market will resolve to \\\"No\\\".\\n\\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be information from MSTR and on-chain data, however a consensus of credible reporting will also be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"microstrategy-sells-any-bitcoin-by-june-30-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-07-01T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-microstrategy-purchase-bitcoin-july-1-7-mzoE5TYk_cCI.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-microstrategy-purchase-bitcoin-july-1-7-mzoE5TYk_cCI.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1000}],\"min_size\":100,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"110251828161543119357013227499774714771527179764174739487025581227481937033858\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.2885,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"65176388692130651396848427090788038285140833850265294793449655516920659740141\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.7115,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Crypto\",\"Business\",\"Finance\",\"Stocks\",\"Economy\",\"MicroStrategy\",\"2025 Predictions\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-15T13:22:41Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xc721711c5c5005bd04e0506a7fd2e62f38df2cf401e02059a10c04a0e3c82ffb\",\"question_id\":\"0x5dd16f7a21616b3beaa789c1c5fe81dd1501dd5810536430bf218356d57cec00\",\"question\":\"Will the Republican Party hold fewer than 22 governorships after the 2026 midterm elections?\",\"description\":\"The 2026 midterm elections are scheduled to be held on November 3, 2026.\\n\\nThis market will resolve according to the party distribution of governors as a result of the 2026 midterm elections.\\n\\nThis market will resolve based on the results of all gubernatorial elections, including special elections, that are scheduled to occur in November 2026 as of October 31, 2026. If a required runoff for any such election could change the market’s outcome, the market will remain open until that runoff is conclusively called by this market’s resolution sources.\\n\\nIf a governorship is vacant but a corresponding election will not be held in November 2026, that seat will be considered held by the party of the seat's most recent incumbent.\\n\\nA candidate's party will be determined by their ballot-listed or otherwise identifiable affiliation with that party at the time all of the November 2026 gubernatorial elections are conclusively called by this market's resolution sources.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the Associated Press, Fox News, and NBC. This market will resolve once all three sources have conclusively called all relevant gubernatorial elections. If all three sources do not achieve consensus in calling the relevant races for this market, it will resolve based on the official certification.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-republican-party-hold-fewer-than-22-governorships-after-the-2026-midterm-elections\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-11-03T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x5dd16f7a21616b3beaa789c1c5fe81dd1501dd5810536430bf218356d57cec00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x309ddc15356576f05c87f3ce8b1baa8ad876cc95089a375f2f662b21ad67b15d\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/how-many-republican-governors-after-the-2026-midterm-elections-HRxY-gXiZAZV.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/how-many-republican-governors-after-the-2026-midterm-elections-HRxY-gXiZAZV.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"98527953404683968927351392535846134688575286140333769930915553620463004327686\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.135,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"100803932570601998076673366656963744476740129766860595018671577048416671048149\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.865,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"United States\",\"US Election\",\"Midterms\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-11T20:57:33Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xd4d841659e8b1fe050980ec9b7deae31accc10e529082fe9468ef9699d11aec2\",\"question_id\":\"0xa36fc1a44aa610e3cebab79416f69cdb9552699c2b6485bec8d89fc6de0e82f7\",\"question\":\"SpaceX IPO closing market cap above $1.8T?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to “Yes” if the official closing price for SpaceX’s market capitalization on its first trading day is above the value specified in the title. Otherwise, it will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nIf no IPO occurs by December 31, 2027, 11:59 PM ET, this market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nMarket capitalization is defined as the total number of outstanding shares multiplied by the closing share price on the first trading day.\\n\\nResolution will be based on the primary exchange’s official listing page. In the event that the relevant figure is not displayed, another reliable source will be used.\\n\\nIn the event of an interruption in the course of the normal trading session on SpaceX’s first day of trading (e.g., a circuit breaker or half-day), the market will resolve according to the official closing price of the abbreviated session. If no such official closing price is published, the market will resolve according to the next trading day on which an official closing price is published, treating that as the first day of trading.\",\"market_slug\":\"spacex-ipo-closing-market-cap-above-1pt8t\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2027-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/spacex-ipo-closing-market-cap-eMcPLOPUo_Il.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/spacex-ipo-closing-market-cap-eMcPLOPUo_Il.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":2}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"80822496881187464044904323930735374814391442763100022480297070361136099568761\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.69,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"30427687464154883708138843011596245466741607842619929142307799202727981279551\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.31,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"SpaceX\",\"Elon Musk\",\"IPOs\",\"Tech\",\"Big Tech\",\"IPO\",\"Climate \\u0026 Science\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2026-01-14T16:02:32Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0xe7e3a16f91f0c00d9d4f8848301a7bc8dcf045929e4e5f3cd83ca71b4088cfd8\",\"question_id\":\"0x590a6a92dec85c5bd81eb408976ac47c30764fb73255960bb4aab7abdb214ea1\",\"question\":\"Will Elon Musk get full custody of the St. Clair child?\",\"description\":\"On January 12, Elon Musk announced he would be filing for full custody of the child he shares with Ashley St. Clair. (see: https://www.eonline.com/news/1427282/elon-musk-filing-for-full-custody-of-son-with-ashley-st-clair)\\n\\nThis market will resolve to \\\"Yes\\\" if Elon Musk is awarded sole legal custody, or primary residential/physical custody of his son Romulus in the form of a final order by any U.S. court by December 31, 2026, 11:59PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to \\\"No\\\".\\n\\nTemporary custody orders or interim arrangements will not qualify this market towards a \\\"Yes\\\" resolution unless they become final orders by the stated market deadline.\\n\\nThis market will resolve immediately to \\\"No\\\" if all relevant court proceedings permanently cease, or are dropped by either party.\\n\\nThis market will resolve based on announcements from Elon Musk, Ashley St. Clair, their official legal or social media representatives, or a consensus of credible reporting.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-elon-musk-get-full-custody-of-the-st-clair-child\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-elon-musk-get-full-custody-of-the-st-clair-child-AsZR6actKe-y.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-elon-musk-get-full-custody-of-the-st-clair-child-AsZR6actKe-y.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"3931694835760592302672587556422933209969262155253159029737490691692326702117\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.0685,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"23139931835897871034595313627276899296293069098051165566229711225565760344423\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.9315,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Elon Musk\",\"Celebrities\",\"Culture\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-19T23:53:27Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x888f977a11c21cce076c0fe2d0be65074ac6836f75be85b9d8e8a90015c50e93\",\"question_id\":\"0x39129c39a78945358a94d892fa37df5a1d56ad1e50527375facde2b88d4b6240\",\"question\":\"Will Mark Cuban announce a Presidential run before 2027?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to “Yes” if the listed individual officially announces that they are running for U.S. President in the 2028 United States presidential election by December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nAn announcement by the listed individual  will be sufficient to trigger a \\\"Yes\\\" resolution, regardless of whether they actually filed a nomination to run, or whether they actually file a nomination to run in the future.\\n\\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be official statements by the listed individual (ex: via speech, social media, etc.), however a consensus of credible reporting may also be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-mark-cuban-announce-a-presidential-run-before-2027\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Mark_Cuban.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/Mark_Cuban.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"68969590833448084243551005403895810407319981556332412070376722429186155928494\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.085,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"83757968538661480788380005221196796149974000492329349719945649865816620342909\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.915,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Celebrities\",\"President\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-07-29T17:22:43Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xfbe85201ab2b4acff01cd5a3639039fc813d3448c64db081f70926bd9b9e74e9\",\"question_id\":\"0x3e140cadcdda618e09c3bc308ce6fb65d4623f7477eb887ea4d03d54aa6ad70a\",\"question\":\"Will Abelardo de la Espriella  win the 2026 Colombian presidential election?\",\"description\":\"Colombia's presidential elections are scheduled for May 31, 2026, and a second round (if required) on June 21, 2026, in case no candidate secures more than 50% of the valid votes in the first round.\\n\\nThis market will resolve according to the listed candidate that wins this election. \\n\\nThis market includes any potential second round. If the result of this election isn't known by December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET, the market will resolve to \\\"Other\\\".\\n\\nThis market will resolve based on the election results, as indicated by a consensus of credible reporting. If there is ambiguity, this market will resolve based solely on the official results as reported by Colombia's National Civil Registry (Registraduría Nacional del Estado Civil) (https://registraduria.gov.co).\",\"market_slug\":\"will-abelardo-de-la-espriella-win-the-2026-colombian-presidential-election\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-21T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x3e140cadcdda618e09c3