versions of previously released songs will not count, unless they contain at least 50% tracks that have never been officially released in any format prior to the album's release.\\n\\nThe primary resolution sources will be official streaming and download platforms. In cases of ambiguity over how a song/album is labeled, the listed resolution sources will be consulted in the following order of precedence: Spotify, Apple Music, YouTube Music, and Deezer.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-kendrick-lamar-release-an-album-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/which-artists-will-release-new-albums-in-2026-0U1xTjC59Y_r.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/which-artists-will-release-new-albums-in-2026-0U1xTjC59Y_r.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"90633861759372555740852149703875448376258793985771040949818672067551420508000\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.485,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"109402847075169198827690185416675749060112049997655558234430477455240433031189\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.515,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Music\",\"Culture\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-19T23:53:27Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x8e7c4e8bb55ea1e2e3011f37f96bc254e156b26cd5ea092a7cade3ca268da7b7\",\"question_id\":\"0xb9a12bd5112f77d6e6fba2a0c5daaeada0e533893669a9c224f49ad69c14f3f2\",\"question\":\"Will Jon Ossoff announce a 