mbiguity, this market will resolve based solely on the official results as reported by the Brazilian government, specifically the Superior Electoral Court (Tribunal Superior Eleitoral, TSE) (e.g., https://dadosabertos.tse.jus.br/).\",\"market_slug\":\"will-romeu-zema-win-the-2026-brazilian-presidential-election\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x966a3221e05d8d0579854c4952085331da2a42989dee0fa033d24cada9dfca00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x8e75ef92d9d991c2b7f1d0f7100fe02aa0261de7aae3855236c1ebb44c9fe102\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-romeu-zema-win-the-2026-brazilian-presidential-election-THlJ5kdmq5Ia.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-romeu-zema-win-the-2026-brazilian-presidential-election-THlJ5kdmq5Ia.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":3}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"44340846524235712899508083510503343345123518718867913608211694999290628967401\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.0435,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"38633448065261608755072088507033278254893488240734399014852176650195563610767\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.9565,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Global Elections\",\"Brazil\",\"World Elections\",\"Macro Election 2\",\"World\",\"Rewards 200, 4.5, 50\",\"Main Election\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-10-13T22:37:59Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x22e986868fae24a9e7b6fff86e063cc90843c85c4a9dd65b2628bbf5663997c7\",\"question_id\":\"0x5a57c20b2083c2dbc50b8fed1cf788313e38592f2f3