dicated by a consensus of credible reporting. If there is ambiguity, this market will resolve based solely on the official results as reported by the United States government, specifically the Federal Election Commission (https://www.fec.gov/).\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-democratic-party-win-the-mi-10-house-seat\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-11-04T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x8bcf8969ad9aea15c3c34b4e142aa41fe12cd7146f5d7d441d9479b3035a0d00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x85e317101fb704331d79c329cf494083d3a07a026e2cbcf34fe7ac138563c744\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-democratic-party-win-the-ca-22-house-seat-sGMEwwv3sh5C.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-democratic-party-win-the-ca-22-house-seat-sGMEwwv3sh5C.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":0.2},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"75685534826787951976275953631896177236439299709473517876953614908104349066066\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.76,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"33304449079649201557387369847379560518290837271024516667508560413437432436345\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.24,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Midterms\",\"Nov 4 Elections\",\"House Elections\",\"Michigan Midterm\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-04T23:27:09Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0xf762b70509052cd499fcb48285f09573113874bb004cb6ab85f3e7d203569de2\",\"question_id\":\"0x69cfddd04a1ce6d4456aba9e527e76f7ffeb01711841a88f98d051d47b98c100\",\"question\":\"Will Aaron Ford win the 2026 Nevada Governor Democratic primary election?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the winner of the Democratic Primary for Governor of Nevada, scheduled to take place on June 9, 2026. Resolution will be based on the overall winner of the primary, including any potential second round or run-off.\\n\\nIf no 2026 Nevada Gubernatorial Democratic Primary takes place, this market will resolve to “Other.”\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be the first official announcement of the results from the Nevada Democratic Party; however, an overwhelming consensus of credible reporting may suffice.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-aaron-ford-win-the-2026-nevada-governor-democratic-primary-election\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-09T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x69cfddd04a1ce6d4456aba9e527e76f7ffeb01711841a88f98d051d47b98c100\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x4692f98a591db110d6795dfde6e78856f0f763cf2480998db37f0017cd88c00c\",\"icon\":\"\",\"image\":\"\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":3}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"44417338467732839899065503448367106299523579770613361668116525638194378243409\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.9465,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"94920468971082819031114214227593297927109286529196795266542864069365254072326\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.0535,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\",\"primary elections\",\"Democratic Primary\",\"Governor Primary\",\"Nevada Primary\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-09-12T20:30:19Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"co