fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-10-year-treasury-yield-dip-below-3pt5-in-2025-vwtsx-rZ8Tge.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-10-year-treasury-yield-dip-below-3pt5-in-2025-vwtsx-rZ8Tge.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"98460221163491257582561784482909447764170654893388981688283099290558156631581\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.559,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"106752699603266763784849736065272688687603139761745952185531728847192670959259\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.441,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Business\",\"Finance\",\"Trump\",\"Fed Rates\",\"Economy\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-13T21:32:28Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x024418fa74e0a95fe9102b5681b73fdc18b7729edbb6550f6322845084c74fea\",\"question_id\":\"0xe0912af633114fc088071aeb29f3abdaceb9efa9b4001074fd0d0da3319e8e1d\",\"question\":\"Will inflation reach more than 10% in 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to “Yes” if the Consumer Price Index (CPI) increased by greater than the listed percent over the 12 month period ending with any month in 2026 according to the monthly Bureau of Labor Statistics (BLS) reports. Otherwise, this market will resolve to \\\"No\\\".\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be the BLS Consumer Price Index reports released for each month of 2026 (https://www.bls.gov/bls/news-release/cpi.htm). Resolution of this market will take place upon release of the aforementioned data.\\n\\nThis market may not resolve to \\\"No\\\" until the December 2026 report is issued. Once the December 2026 report is issued, any revisions to previously released CPI figures will not be counted toward this market's resolution. If the CPI report for December 2026 is not issued by January 31, 2027, 11:59 PM ET, this market will resolve based on CPI figures which have already been made available by the BLS.\\n\\nNote: the resolution source for this market will be the official monthly BLS CPI news release which reports inflation over 12 month periods to only one decimal point (e.g. 2.9%). Thus, this is the level of precision that will be used when resolving the market.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-inflation-reach-more-than-10-in-2026-741\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/how-high-will-inflation-get-in-2025-uvsYb27mqBpZ.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/how-high-will-inflation-get-in-2025-uvsYb27mqBpZ.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":3}],\"min_size\":100,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"767313090619807826078795132250383167293948459067280703809263365919638960162\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.0465,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"10153831923325880603381379908339829878083120649911689146876869023280998215166\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.9535,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Inflation\",\"Economy\",\"Macro Indicators\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-20T23:01:21Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0xd0dc167a8390914eaae948681eb70add44ca08147cae46bb2d1d800bfc11fb73\",\"question_id\":\"0x40aa6389fd3e62f022292ecc397620484d54fb585463cf568c8918508d9c2701\",\"question\":\"Will Jack Doherty be sentenced to less than 2 years in prison?\",\"description\":\"YouTuber Jack Doherty was recently arrested in Miami, Florida and charged with possession of a controlled substance (amphetamine), possession of 20 grams or less of marijuana, and resisting an officer without violence.\\n\\nThis market will resolve according to the prison sentence, if any, imposed on Jack Doherty in relation to these charges by October 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET.\\n\\nThis market will resolve immediately based on the first sentence rendered in relation to these charges, regardless of any appeals. If the charges are tried separately, this market will stay open until the first sentence has been rendered for all three charges and will resolve based on the cumulative sentence imposed across all three charges. If sentencing has taken place for some, but not all, of these charges on October 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET, this market will resolve based on sentencing up to that point.\\n\\nIf Doherty is found not guilty, there is a mistrial, or if his sentencing does not include any jail or prison time, this market will resolve to \\\"No Prison Time.\\\"\\n\\nIf no sentencing takes place by October 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET, this market will also resolve to \\\"No Prison Time.\\\"\\n\\nIf the sentence falls exactly between two brackets, then this market will resolve to the higher range bracket.\\n\\nFor the purposes of this market, it does not matter whether the sentence is concurrent or consecutive to any existing sentence Doherty is already serving. The market will resolve based on the total prison sentence imposed in this case.\\n\\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be official information from the Florida court system or other involved U.S. government sources; however, a consensus of credible reporting may also be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-jack-doherty-be-sentenced-to-less-than-2-years-in-prison\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-10-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x40aa6389fd3e62f022292ecc397620484d54fb585463cf568c8918508d9c2700\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x849abe5a30a443e0e3781055c22b740086dca9066f87e746077febf00b9759b9\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/jack-doherty-prison-time-LXu3vfKt8_p5.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/jack-doherty-prison-time-LXu3vfKt8_p5.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"18981868109290553221951324177778200476532261282534472001510370144960148811735\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.0465,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"20020868039748391333362973116283166064398033565517234945300642803569629364097\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.9535,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"YouTube\",\"Celebrities\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-25T21:54:49Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xb8a3ea065baae7536ca832160dd9851a06645b7de509eedec34be15c9e18d850\",\"question_id\":\"0xaba9323c65ba4150511c087158813190ad66049c68b30c581671c664b3dc8500\",\"question\":\"Will Sharif Street be the Democratic nominee for PA-03?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the candidate who wins the nomination for the Democratic Party to contest the PA-03 congressional district seat in the U.S. House of Representatives in the 2026 midterm elections. The Democratic primary will take place on May 19, 2026.\\n\\nIf no nominee is announced by November 3, 2026, 11:59PM ET, this market will resolve to \\\"Other\\\".\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be a consensus of official Democrat sources, including https://democrats.org/.\\n\\nAny replacement of the nominee before election day will not change the resolution of the market.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-sharif-street-be-the-democratic-nominee-for-pa-03\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-05-19T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xaba9323c65ba4150511c087158813190ad66049c68b30c581671c664b3dc8500\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x8d390944c0f15aa943b87c41f06f680019dc10460085690da52d3a00d203a92b\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/pa-03-democratic-primary-winner-3x1fJMVfQICs.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/pa-03-democratic-primary-winner-3x1fJMVfQICs.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":3}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"32260641813349643129600693193678961748956019559459960413590366169688244927580\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.545,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"33015860821735669217459468225855332345163620932345805466441388443471565662984\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.455,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\",\"primary elections\",\"Democratic Primary\",\"House Primary\",\"Pennsylvania Primary\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-04T23:39:25Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xc8e04fba8bc6d19cf3d53454b05a87a09601e4ff814ab0fc21c22106c6bd17f4\",\"question_id\":\"0xffd10aea1244094a4755accec8ca0945a07ce5e3d402e800afab3e2de09c4300\",\"question\":\"Will Cyndi Munson win the 2026 Oklahoma Governor Democratic primary election?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the winner of the Democratic Primary for Governor of Oklahoma, scheduled to take place on June 16, 2026. Resolution will be based on the overall winner of the primary, including any potential second round or run-off.\\n\\nIf no 2026 Oklahoma Gubernatorial Democratic Primary takes place, this market will resolve to “Other.”\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be the first official announcement of the results from the Oklahoma Democratic Party; however, an overwhelming consensus of credible reporting may suffice.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-cyndi-munson-win-the-2026-oklahoma-governor-democratic-primary-election\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xffd10aea1244094a4755accec8ca0945a07ce5e3d402e800afab3e2de09c4300\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0xd727763f7ef723b09bde720b36ecad00ea4477c7d668215a95c0d0aa2d9e3e8f\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/oklahoma-governor-democratic-primary-winner-i4qn60YRGI8I.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/oklahoma-governor-democratic-primary-winner-i4qn60YRGI8I.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":3}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"41527155527852087693176392512971392210661572882199771696500264397765856556139\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.86,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"100600552446359109325435782409031791786996573065964214821925359115253385434336\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.14,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\",\"primary elections\",\"Democratic Primary\",\"Governor Primary\",\"Oklahoma Primary\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-10-13T21:03:55Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x5554740293afa7aafd5fed10fd2de43a898e2884c1f98bd65185e703f371b9db\",\"question_id\":\"0x42dca29b6da9c3c0b339f53ba22cfe6ec8abc0e8f7356a9ff1f2446e4f9ac702\",\"question\":\"Will an independent win the Nebraska Senate race in 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the winner of the 2026 midterm Nebraska U.S. Senate election, inclusive of any run-offs.\\n\\nA candidate shall be considered to represent a party in the event that he or she is the nominee of the party in question. Candidates other than the Democratic or Republican nominee (e.g., Greens, Libertarian, independent) may be added at a later date.\\n\\nCandidates who run as independents will not be encompassed by the “Democrat” or “Republican” options regardless of any affiliation they may have with the party.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the Associated Press, Fox News, and NBC. This market will resolve once all three sources call the race for the same candidate. If all three sources haven’t called the race in this state for the same candidate, this market will resolve based on the official certification.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-an-independent-win-the-nebraska-senate-race-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-11-03T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x42dca29b6da9c3c0b339f53ba22cfe6ec8abc0e8f7356a9ff1f2446e4f9ac700\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0xccd980155eff32ce5cd5f2ff26987d2bcf23625e2be9fcb1308a558ce79002cc\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/nebraska-senate-election-winner-PShczHfizy6S.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/nebraska-senate-election-winner-PShczHfizy6S.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"47975366268282823322598946778919483335780002591367838795894307024076579116518\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.3,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"89524111316754281233016446935787527194216234343076592935555965327756401377156\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.7,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"US Election\",\"Midterms\",\"Nebraska Midterm\",\"Senate midterms\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-04T23:19:41Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x88d4a41111c33e2488fc49f561d67c87f838096ef22db8a897d32d1cb61d86bc\",\"question_id\":\"0x85af1e650818781d2c922104c13732a255727faa402ecb20cdb03c9b34dd3d27\",\"question\":\"Will Brandon Jones advance from the 2026 California Governor primary election?\",\"description\":\"The non-partisan primary election for Governor of California is scheduled to take place on June 2, 2026. The top two candidates in this election by number of votes won will advance to the general election for Governor of California.\\n\\nThis market will resolve to “Yes” If the listed candidate advances from the primary to the general election for Governor of California. Otherwise this market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nIf no 2026 California gubernatorial primary takes place by December 31, 2026, this market will resolve to “No.”\\n\\nThis market will resolve based on the results of the primary election for Governor of California as indicated by a consensus of credible reporting. If there is ambiguity, this market will resolve based solely on the official results as reported by the government of California, specifically the Office of the Secretary of State.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-brandon-jones-get-the-first-or-second-most-votes-in-the-2026-california-governor-primary-election\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-02T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/california-governor-election-2026-4b5HcLPNupez.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/california-governor-election-2026-4b5HcLPNupez.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"108338622091585666240606883039431727197281128080866120370410978764266210934414\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.013,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"8755178911940705591804492412445969332846975369978785939946314505159045479824\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.987,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2026-01-22T00:27:40Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xe6e0dd575ce5f8754ea0d7201c87ae14b2c7ea4a6998491aa036dc5240f35e56\",\"question_id\":\"0xee66d485c80e11ce638ac6e79645cdae80ac0f8f893452c3cc4970e4efa5b707\",\"question\":\"Will the UK’s 2026 inflation be at least 4.5%?\",\"description\":\"This is a market about the variation of consumer prices in the U.K. over the 12-month period ending December 2026, before seasonal adjustment, as reported by the Office for National Statistics (ONS).\\n\\nThis market will resolve according to the percentage change in the Consumer Price Index (CPI) over the 12-month period ending December 2026, according to the monthly ONS report.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be the ONS Consumer Price Index monthly report released for December 2026 (https://www.ons.gov.uk/economy/inflationandpriceindices/bulletins/consumerpriceinflation/previousreleases), currently scheduled to be released on January 20, 2027. Resolution of this market will take place upon release of the aforementioned data. If no data for the specified month is released by the date the next month's data is scheduled to be released, this market will resolve based on data from the last available month.\\n\\nYou can find this report by choosing the report for the relevant month from the previous releases page for price indices on the ONS website (https://www.ons.gov.uk/economy/inflationandpriceindices/bulletins/consumerpriceinflation/previousreleases). The relevant figure can be found in the \\\"Consumer price inflation rates\\\" table under the column labeled \\\"CPI 12-month rate (%)\\\" for the relevant month.\\n\\nNote: the resolution source for this market will be the official monthly ONS CPI news release which reports inflation change over 12-month periods to only one decimal point (e.g. 1.9%). Thus, this is the level of precision that will be used when resolving the market. For the full release schedule, see: https://www.ons.gov.uk/releasecalendar\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-uks-2026-inflation-be-at-least-4pt5\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2027-01-20T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xee66d485c80e11ce638ac6e79645cdae80ac0f8f893452c3cc4970e4efa5b700\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x46e15f0865afc06738196e4d0abc27e9af35209ce286a08d3e63e94e3f1a4b32\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/november-inflation-uk-monthly-zzYsCJIERYv3.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/november-inflation-uk-monthly-zzYsCJIERYv3.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"49867388566575210787745989613296824339463843722522458024889408141428017216406\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.415,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"37647506269789123155676262616516333949390821793312774705507423154841115628427\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.585,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Inflation\",\"UK\",\"Economy\",\"cpi\",\"Macro Indicators\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-10-13T22:42:45Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x4ff66babd9440e4ca4097607aafa868bf734c5411463e14bffc5c330d7d0f524\",\"question_id\":\"0x209f8d606f15a4f4dcb6ebf018d50c4934e9c5dd1302115d8d7aa72fa9442c02\",\"question\":\"Will an independent win the Rhode Island governor race in 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the winner of the 2026 Rhode Island gubernatorial election.\\n\\nA candidate shall be considered to represent a party in the event that he or she is the nominee of the party in question. Candidates other than the Democratic or Republican nominee (e.g., Greens, Libertarian, independent) may be added at a later date.\\n\\nCandidates who run as independents will not be encompassed by the “Democrat” or “Republican” options regardless of any affiliation they may have with the party.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the Associated Press, Fox News, and NBC. This market will resolve once all three sources call the race for the same candidate. If all three sources haven’t called the race in this state for the same candidate, this market will resolve based on the official certification.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-an-independent-win-the-rhode-island-governor-race-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":null,\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x209f8d606f15a4f4dcb6ebf018d50c4934e9c5dd1302115d8d7aa72fa9442c00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x2f62b3e3ea3b3958c8e167e682191014411be849e07194c8699fbe32efc9b1ba\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/rhode-island-governor-winner-2026-zZLNUfjI4sCP.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/rhode-island-governor-winner-2026-zZLNUfjI4sCP.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"13165388174900569619328636459480727052834519645059869980549561071064022087971\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.027,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"111202902854619594912757736606690792075061552960837186030975224474972751918924\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.973,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"US Election\",\"Midterms\",\"Rhode Island Midterm\",\"Governor midterms\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-10-13T23:26:17Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x97d482b6e4872befd1d18788d262a2775021b58e9fbbcb86515799338d85a8f5\",\"question_id\":\"0x4ce0e3c685c89120b7685d7b2c43cfd792f706bd45dc071aa35e27dbb2424301\",\"question\":\"Will the Republicans win the Maryland governor race in 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the winner of the 2026 Maryland gubernatorial election.\\n\\nA candidate shall be considered to represent a party in the event that he or she is the nominee of the party in question. Candidates other than the Democratic or Republican nominee (e.g., Greens, Libertarian, independent) may be added at a later date.\\n\\nCandidates who run as independents will not be encompassed by the “Democrat” or “Republican” options regardless of any affiliation they may have with the party.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the Associated Press, Fox News, and NBC. This market will resolve once all three sources call the race for the same candidate. If all three sources haven’t called the race in this state for the same candidate, this market will resolve based on the official certification.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-republicans-win-the-maryland-governor-race-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":null,\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x4ce0e3c685c89120b7685d7b2c43cfd792f706bd45dc071aa35e27dbb2424300\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x1c58b2bcad51f7d4e517d62c90f8b7c4a32f3d320926500a9f3bde5882d9c58a\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-republican-party-control-the-senate-after-the-2026-midterm-elections-JSsqogfn0U0u.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-republican-party-control-the-senate-after-the-2026-midterm-elections-JSsqogfn0U0u.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"99454680080858182975916786322594927636228275589135289499749895045005789315019\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.055,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"56155921462165675245063764296994337178368244177849069777989554232578924728272\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.945,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"US Election\",\"Midterms\",\"Maryland Midterm\",\"Governor midterms\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-01T21:01:54Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xd426b5e37b1adeb4a30ed0ece09fe70b5ca0aee2392a43c97b18af26b3fec447\",\"question_id\":\"0xd83ef2d66b68877ea06b54b6760fd29df3df936a5cfe5ddaff6a5dbc562a5f00\",\"question\":\"Will Laura Gillen be the Democratic nominee for NY-04?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the candidate who wins the nomination for the Democratic Party to contest the NY-04 congressional district seat in the U.S. House of Representatives in the 2026 midterm elections. The Democratic primary will take place on June 23, 2026.\\n\\nIf no nominee is announced by November 3, 2026, 11:59PM ET, this market will resolve to \\\"Other\\\".\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be a consensus of official Democrat sources, including https://democrats.org/.\\n\\nAny replacement of the nominee before election day will not change the resolution of the market.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-laura-gillen-be-the-democratic-nominee-for-ny-04\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-23T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xd83ef2d66b68877ea06b54b6760fd29df3df936a5cfe5ddaff6a5dbc562a5f00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0xed83242436686f85e303f1c0d1b5075d9ee238736619df123f0d57a951fdf174\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/who-will-be-the-democratic-nominee-for-ny-12-sL9s2x0LnsR1.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/who-will-be-the-democratic-nominee-for-ny-12-sL9s2x0LnsR1.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":3}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"31903753668568580194519745519436307034343004688882823786562874898525719905121\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.765,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"52087909301984001009522958878332816194878042148980764948870893996379225172213\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.235,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\",\"primary elections\",\"Democratic Primary\",\"House Primary\",\"New York Primary\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-26T19:41:05Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x48b6208c56c2bac5c29f4c91e951c2c17d706b38168d0487860e449a0bffb01a\",\"question_id\":\"0x8bbec2b850c3bd91e3d92641f2a62d51ad320c4c738a5f7348a5280bde796bd3\",\"question\":\"Will Trump recognize Somaliland before 2027?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to \\\"Yes\\\" if the United States formally recognizes the Republic of Somaliland as a sovereign state by December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to \\\"No\\\".\\n\\nOnly formal recognition of Somaliland will qualify. Statements/actions which acknowledge the Republic of Somaliland, or change its diplomatic status with the U.S. but do not formally recognize the country as a sovereign state will not qualify.\\n\\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be official information from the government of the United States, however a consensus of credible reporting will also be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-trump-recognize-somaliland-before-2027\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":0,\"taker_base_fee\":0,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-e