ovision rules.\\n\\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be official information from Eurovision (https://eurovision.tv/), including live footage of Eurovision 2026, however a consensus of credible reporting will suffice.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-denmark-win-eurovision-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-05-16T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xca3e6d866434291855e71f79828e2d622bd54f14c739155acee7a80a8f278b00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x5f8bbe51d4e1578af15ec8ed95589164ec225d6ee35afc694beff3d0f46b879f\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-denmark-win-eurovision-2026-2w9KICTiy-TZ.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-denmark-win-eurovision-2026-2w9KICTiy-TZ.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":12}],\"min_size\":100,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"76966216861676765455847161978020811345081637695305334651438116829300115482952\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.1315,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"1341836513694035044774786089119807482413331966430938512146332415566136167272\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.8685,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Awards\",\"Music\",\"Culture\",\"rewards 100, 4.5, 100\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-25T21:55:05Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x49f4f5e99bc76806bdce33713e6958a3a35c55405d909b9f546b2632d9ec55c3\",\"question_id\":\"0x621cbfd923ae0b292a28b1e702e9a4912d86ddd7b3d17b8b992016417a32a801\",\"question\":\"Will Nate Blouin be the Democratic nominee for UT-01?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the cand