rg/sea-ice-today/sea-ice-tools. If this resolution source becomes unavailable, another resolution source will be chosen.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-minimum-arctic-sea-ice-extent-this-summer-be-between-4pt4m-4pt6m-square-kilometers\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-10-01T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xa34e00065950bc32cade4faed3bdf05ac7cac0ad9961a106517df2fb94876a00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x9550db5c6c9c435970ae189e16ea9855d2fd9a88399cb53f11a95904aa4f7c5a\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/min-arctic-sea-ice-extent-this-summer-mVyiDnH-v2P5.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/min-arctic-sea-ice-extent-this-summer-mVyiDnH-v2P5.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"14498449069171140091048210767776675275470228043361909433802738866555161832365\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.0635,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"98472882426703135322986392088398913409842886502229843982890694665612639942233\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.9365,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Weather\",\"climate\",\"Climate Change\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-19T23:53:31Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xd9a9a78baeeda8e32538e0391a579f79f8d4b763537bc3c071ad39912f56c565\",\"question_id\":\"0x3e538752485daaf3261fb6d3303497834082c5159a93ea41cded379bd8b66648\",\"question\":\"Will Pete Buttigieg announce a Presidential run before 2027?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to “Yes” if the listed individual officially announces that they are running for U.S. President in the 2028 United States presidential election by December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nAn announcement by the listed individual  will be sufficient to trigger a \\\"Yes\\\" resolution, regardless of whether they actually filed a nomination to run, or whether they actually file a nomination to run in the future.\\n\\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be official statements by the listed individual (ex: via speech, social media, etc.), however a consensus of credible reporting may also be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-pete-buttigieg-announce-a-presidential-run-before-2027\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-pete-buttigieg-win-the-2028-us-presidential-election-jPrwim0rDJDu.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-pete-buttigieg-win-the-2028-us-presidential-election-jPrwim0rDJDu.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":2}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"8417857546958031155821215581110737289791302897905295446747739284425459874523\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.155,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"9964097195311235733398693100415815396041489703268984002195092262246370100623\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.845,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Celebrities\",\"President\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-17T23:55:21Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x4