The resolution source for this market will be a consensus of official Democrat sources, including https://democrats.org/.\\n\\nAny replacement of the nominee before election day will not change the resolution of the market.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-ben-mcadams-be-the-democratic-nominee-for-ut-01\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-23T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x621cbfd923ae0b292a28b1e702e9a4912d86ddd7b3d17b8b992016417a32a800\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x4dab3091bbadae2f9f942b4a7b40ebc781b842d30a16c763681bb6cb61362de8\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/ut-01-democratic-primary-winner-UrRWnHnGDcH5.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/ut-01-democratic-primary-winner-UrRWnHnGDcH5.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"72548626523736472457326961446257598465068713097216042137859430107646060867095\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.735,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"21641203507271799283487448524650701817083724258255143249251037733008767404524\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.265,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\",\"primary elections\",\"Democratic Primary\",\"House Primary\",\"Utah Primary\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-01T17:56:46Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x1d916047bbca1be9808076a0590c17ff113fb92986a4b4bc7f0f962642158827\",\"question_id\":\"0x8e39bf8209a753b0bf2e78acb67d632707b29548b0ab014ce0f23c6d2599f40d\",\"question\":\"Will there be at least 10000 measles cases in the U.S. in 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to \\\"Yes\\\" if there have been the specified amount or more confirmed cases of Measles (Rubeola) in humans in the territory of the United States of America in 2026 according to the CDC case counter between January 1, 2026, 12:00 AM ET and December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to \\\"No\\\".\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be the CDC Measles (Rubeola) counter (see: https://www.cdc.gov/measles/data-research/index.html) at the resolution time. If the counter becomes unavailable, another credible source will be used.\\n\\nNote: Only cases reported by the CDC Measles (Rubeola) counter will qualify, regardless of reports from U.S. State agencies or other sources.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-there-be-at-least-10000-measles-cases-in-the-us-in-2026-418-668-617\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":0,\"taker_base_fee\":0,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/1200-measles-cases-in-us-before-june-jPVnjl81lNC-.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/1200-measles-cases-in-us-before-june-jPVnjl81lNC-.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"108666902993460052548356894576792031068019553485832706137527731404107083354939\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.0845,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"61371441917995783761706990607573951646880237796683453244719301289670873215471\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.9155,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Science\",\"Weather\",\"Pandemics\",\"Measles\",\"Climate \\u0026 Science\",\"Rewards 20, 4.5, 50\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-19T23:53:37Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x7c6a08863df20384770b3175903f017e31598e0a95cb943d400c060566fb8865\",\"question_id\":\"0x6c09afce6ca14174e505be2bf9004d772aa89a1ae0a178a94288cdff5d984959\",\"question\":\"Will Tulsi Gabbard announce a presidential run before 2027?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to “Yes” if the listed individual announces that they are running for President in the 2028 United States presidential election by December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nAn announcement by the listed individual  will be sufficient to trigger a \\\"Yes\\\" resolution, regardless of whether they actually filed a nomination to run, or whether they actually file a nomination to run in the future.\\n\\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be official statements by the listed individual (ex: via speech, social media, etc.), however a consensus of credible reporting may also be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-tulsi-gabbard-announce-a-presidential-run-before-2027\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-tulsi-gabbard-win-the-2028-us-presidential-election-0cQT8aWX-zIp.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-tulsi-gabbard-win-the-2028-us-presidential-election-0cQT8aWX-zIp.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"12269342360060214152617027308054219065184696885255846968059