\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-24T20:46:37Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0xc2eb25cc0589fc71930ed14485a4c6d90e1dbcc31e0a0854083520514954dbd0\",\"question_id\":\"0xd6a08219afb96fda449c239f432b027d213ffc038483997d0df2ca9a6ccb0054\",\"question\":\"Will Dogecoin reach $0.16 by December 31, 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will immediately resolve to “Yes” if any Binance 1-minute candle for Dogecoin (DOGE/USDT) between November 24, 2025, 15:45 and December 31, 2026, 23:59 in the ET timezone has a final “High” price equal to or greater than the price specified in the title. Otherwise, this market will resolve to “No.”\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is Binance, specifically the DOGE/USDT “High” prices available at:\\nhttps://www.binance.com/en/trade/DOGE_USDT with the chart set to “1m” (one-minute candles) on the top bar.\\n\\nPlease note that the outcome of this market depends solely on the price data from the Binance DOGE/USDT trading pair. Prices from other exchanges, different trading pairs, or spot markets will not be considered for the resolution of this market.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-dogecoin-reach-0pt16-by-december-31-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2027-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/dogecoin-up-or-down-on-june-26-bFVnEB4SYmSJ.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/dogecoin-up-or-down-on-june-26-bFVnEB4SYmSJ.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"60903392111802693735859515714166885011585605346987604156263431322906154321888\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.4995,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"20753914832003880231018583851323087111301830678367917301852624754968796892796\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.5005,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Crypto\",\"Crypto Prices\",\"Dogecoin\",\"Hit Price\",\"Yearly\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-04T23:19:39Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x7ca1634d4f979ba3b1fcb75d1e9516bcca777006019bf5f456a692f37374c3bb\",\"question_id\":\"0x3a7b7d53006134366f487d925af97c16365ce088ceb411c8ca2163d25c2cc64f\",\"question\":\"Will Antonio Villaraigosa advance from the 2026 California Governor primary election?\",\"description\":\"The non-partisan primary election for Governor of California is scheduled to take place on June 2, 2026. The top two candidates in this election by number of votes won will advance to the general election for Governor of California.\\n\\nThis market will resolve to “Yes” If the listed candidate advances from the primary to the general election for Governor of California. Otherwise this market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nIf no 2026 California gubernatorial primary takes place by December 31, 2026, this market will resolve to “No.”\\n\\nThis market will resolve based on the results of the primary election for Governor of California as indicated by a consensus of credible reporting. If there is ambiguity, this market will resolve based solely on the official results as reported by the government of California, specifically the Office of the Secretary of State.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-antonio-villaraigosa-get-the-first-or-second-most-votes-in-the-2026-california-governor-primary-election\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-02T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/california-governor-election-2026-4b5HcLPNupez.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/california-governor-election-2026-4b5HcLPNupez.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"26999791850911469800446908990985665044109064517548480280831645606495361749926\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.0185,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"25298978725312628077307956743582238360182736802218006152850518461164616798030\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.9815,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-18T20:37:55Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x2bb4294142c311763ca6be27ceffcef132f5ac8281f98a62abe02f6e6a8c0107\",\"question_id\":\"0x144e437a13411a887007853a07c65946c6c95b837762627b58bfd51fd1f3ef52\",\"question\":\"Will the Fed’s lower bound reach 2.75% or lower before 2027?\",\"description\":\"The FED interest rates are defined in this market by the lower or the upper bound of the target federal funds range. The decisions on the target federal fund range are made by the Federal Open Market Committee (FOMC) meetings.\\n\\nThis market will resolve to “Yes” if the lower or the upper bound of the target federal funds rate reaches the specified level at any point by December 31, 2026, 12:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to “No.”\\n\\nEmergency rate cuts and hikes outside the regularly scheduled meetings will be considered.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the official website of the Federal Reserve at:\\nhttps://www.federalreserve.gov/monetarypolicy/openmarket.htm.\\n\\nThis market may resolve as soon as the relevant data showing the reached level is published.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-feds-lower-bound-reach-2pt75-or-lower-before-2027-448-727-854\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/fed-rate-cut-in-2025-8aDiUiuri3_D.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/fed-rate-cut-in-2025-8aDiUiuri3_D.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":5}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"17682183447223123479988952873452690236608652508609100470364905844731048770925\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.095,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"23075036871051292036633100296923195842080149789926568755122365949307390731298\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.905,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Fed\",\"Fed Rates\",\"Economy\",\"Jerome Powell\",\"Economic Policy\",\"Macro Indicators\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-15T15:47:17Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xa6a9daa0a7576efdf9edef5095c120059c80f0ddf6a5af75e0b000a646e0d16e\",\"question_id\":\"0x3aded5d3ef7e369922888f4ac55ca2a4f55f7efc6a5936c60c204f6327c10365\",\"question\":\"Will the average monthly Ethereum gas price hit 5 Gwei before 2027?\",\"description\":\"his market will resolve to “Yes” if the average monthly Ethereum gas price is equal to or greater than the value specified in the title by December 31, 2026 ET. Otherwise, the market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the dashboard available at https://dune.com/nibty/eth-gas-prices, using the “mean_gas” value displayed in the “Gas Prices Monthly Average” tab.\\n\\nThis market will resolve as soon as a finalized average monthly gas price shown on the dashboard is equal to or greater than the value specified in the title, or once the value for December 2026 is finalized and no earlier finalized monthly value has met or exceeded that threshold.\\n\\nA monthly value will be considered finalized once the next monthly data point is published.\\n\\nIf the resolution source becomes permanently unavailable, the market will resolve based on other reliable crypto data sources.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-average-monthly-ethereum-gas-price-hit-5-gwei-before-2027\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2027-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/what-will-the-average-monthly-ethereum-gas-price-hit-before-2027--ceukZtMx5o_.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/what-will-the-average-monthly-ethereum-gas-price-hit-before-2027--ceukZtMx5o_.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"40857835778606083269545737690918842295223704526175143893728294436131619750624\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.34,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"54966731196466835608133542281801345015092370033389469354641132258198786698380\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.66,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Crypto\",\"Ethereum\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\