tly prevented from fulfilling the duties of the specified position within this market’s timeframe, it will qualify for a “Yes” resolution.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be official information from Vladimir Putin and the government of Russia; however, a consensus of credible reporting may also be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"putin-out-before-2027\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"0x95bc3b1bd9E0a76faD6F8B177187A32360A78b32\",\"maker_base_fee\":0,\"taker_base_fee\":0,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/putin-out-as-president-of-russia-in-2025-nWuurkC8qfbi.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/putin-out-as-president-of-russia-in-2025-nWuurkC8qfbi.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":100}],\"min_size\":200,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"350977769852917329387037893294763093471844346281449484439085576212613048126\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.115,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"87073899845581463485186346288398658568334162612963837182986759797304993556208\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.885,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Russia\",\"Ukraine\",\"putin\",\"Geopolitics\",\"World\",\"Earn 4%\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-19T23:53:33Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xbfff23136ecd51c8ab9b5027c2dc1a4b83f85b1b3848547cea36a1eb97fcb3f6\",\"question_id\":\"0xd233a7ee9c75b37b02009bb49922a7ac58e41dd51ffc419ec8ace98dce2d2834\",\"question\":\"Will Rahm Emanuel announce a Presidential run before 2027?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to “Yes” if the listed individual officially announces that they are running for U.S. President in the 2028 United States presidential election by December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nAn announcement by the listed individual  will be sufficient to trigger a \\\"Yes\\\" resolution, regardless of whether they actually filed a nomination to run, or whether they actually file a nomination to run in the future.\\n\\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be official statements by the listed individual (ex: via speech, social media, etc.), however a consensus of credible reporting may also be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-rahm-emanuel-announce-a-presidential-run-before-2027\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/rahm.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/rahm.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"39579477725474272503469014118226454398632444358661611481831301604861464986416\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.305,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"52202203927275853998348676919818434618395140675995872313729986208707524282240\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.695,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Celebrities\",\"President\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-07T21:20:33Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x51cc0614ea1f7bec1578cc308d2514e2d2cbe0501707bba7f0eea17652956e44\",\"question_id\":\"0xd8d5e8429cd06b3d91e3ac24e732386b61f29c1e4a73bd284b955424151ab273\",\"question\":\"NYSE marketwide circuit breaker before 2027?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to \\\"Yes\\\" if a marketwide circuit breaker is triggered on the New York Stock Exchange (NYSE) at any time between November 7, 2025, and December 31, 2026. Otherwise, this market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nA marketwide circuit breaker is defined as a trading halt that is initiated due to significant declines in the S\\u0026P 500 Index, specifically a Level 1, Level 2, or Level 3 halt as per NYSE rules.\\n\\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be official information from the NYSE, however a consensus of credible reporting will also be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"nyse-marketwide-circuit-breaker-before-2027\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/nyse-circuit-breaker-in-august-KM7kqMxTE63a.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/nyse-circuit-breaker-in-august-KM7kqMxTE63a.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":5}],\"min_size\":100,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"10776578084439550181526173165818979034936800182797800156144227188229495479910\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.205,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"47244521176243504831320010374030626206943608425325384795080723420898313839532\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.795,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Business\",\"Finance\",\"Stocks\",\"Economy\",\"NYSE\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2026-01-14T19:55:18Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x21ac6c0f306c50f07c5ab8486b36b67320598e69350fda84b6dad1c69805fa4a\",\"question_id\":\"0x7b918aadb121f97482aeec3c0e0426731d33785e3eb7d68a28153659e69b7b00\",\"question\":\"Will Democratic Senate incumbents win all their nominating elections in the 2026 cycle?\",\"description\":\"The 2026 midterm elections are scheduled to be held on November 3, 2026, with congressional primaries running from March through September.\\n\\nThis market will resolve according to the number of Democratic Senate incumbents who do not win their nominating election to move on to the general election as a result of the 2026 midterm primary elections.\\n\\nAn incumbent will be considered not to have won their election if they are not declared the winner of the election they sought, including if they withdraw, suspend, or otherwise leave the race at any point after officially registering as a candidate, regardless of the reason. Incumbents who do not officially register as candidates for reelection will not be considered.\\n\\nThis market will resolve based on the results of all Senate nominating elections, including party primaries, top-two or jungle primaries, and primaries for special elections, that are scheduled to occur between March 1 and September 30, 2026. If a required runoff for any such election or a subsequent qualifying round in a non-partisan primary system could change the market’s outcome, the market will remain open until that contest is conclusively called by this market’s resolution sources.\\n\\nA candidate's party will be determined by their ballot-listed or otherwise identifiable affiliation with that party at the time of their nominating election. A candidate without a ballot-listed affiliation to either the Democratic or Republican parties will be considered a member of one of these parties based on the party with which they most recently expressed their intent to caucus prior to the conclusion of the relevant nominating election.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be the Associated Press, Fox News, and NBC. This market will resolve once all three sources have conclusively called all relevant nominating elections. If all three sources do not achieve consensus in calling the relevant races for this market, it will resolve based on official state certification of the nominating election results.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-democratic-senate-incumbents-win-all-their-nominating-elections-in-the-2026-cycle\",\"end_date_iso\":null,\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x7b918aadb121f97482aeec3c0e0426731d33785e3eb7d68a28153659e69b7b00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x94acff47d97088f5494647d297e4783b2366352b172080c4db8c66a3d13f05a0\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-republicans-lose-a-seat-in-the-us-senate-for-any-state-trump-won-in-2024-36T8qr8R2Va9.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-republicans-lose-a-seat-in-the-us-senate-for-any-state-trump-won-in-2024-36T8qr8R2Va9.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"103985898194829307449653461161637243326370684460246055444724347882642172383340\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.77,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"23411028360487974349213237210627735285357606484118123955633612785654296298646\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.23,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Trump\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\",\"Congress\",\"US Election\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-10-30T00:29:07Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x66f5b8203ee1c36b993af623fd7f9ef7271dd87b3aebf6df508048ad4b563432\",\"question_id\":\"0xf77b2e8a0dd47689758a3ba166c0e6d32e28c63344228ab20cac5cb365dae6b1\",\"question\":\"Will OpenAI IPO by December 31 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to \\\"Yes\\\" if OpenAI completes an Initial Public Offering (IPO) by the listed date ET, as confirmed by official company announcements and credible news sources. Otherwise, this market will resolve to \\\"No\\\".\\n\\nThe IPO refers to the first sale of stock by the listed company to the public on any recognized stock exchange.\\n\\nIf OpenAI is acquired by another company that is already public, this market will immediately resolve to \\\"No.\\\"\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is a consensus of credible reporting.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-openai-ipo-by-december-31-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":null,\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/openai-ipo-by-qeh3ouQDANVw.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/openai-ipo-by-qeh3ouQDANVw.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":3}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"78959017184382580042532738046363918551357602274462396865643365060706535362447\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.33,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"10592971839058012204379818734015951513876214421642216097933518020153836601713\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.67,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Business\",\"Finance\",\"AI\",\"IPOs\",\"Tech\",\"Big Tech\",\"IPO\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-09-18T20:07:44Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x05297f854d3b757d5e51a1a29c7f225a80b14b2a161d6b7f9a61677da7a80ced\",\"question_id\":\"0x966a3221e05d8d0579854c4952085331da2a42989dee0fa033d24cada9dfca07\",\"question\":\"Will Renan Santos win the 2026 Brazilian presidential election?\",\"description\":\"A presidential election is scheduled to take place in Brazil on October 4, 2026.\\n\\nThis market will resolve according to the listed candidate that wins this election.\\n\\nThis market includes any potential second round. If the result of this election isn't known by June 30, 2027, 11:59 PM ET, the market will resolve to \\\"Other\\\".\\n\\nThis market will resolve based on the result of the election as indicated by a consensus of credible reporting. If there is ambiguity, this market will resolve based solely on the official results as reported by the Brazilian government, specifically the Superior Electoral Court (Tribunal Superior Eleitoral, TSE) (e.g., https://dadosabertos.tse.jus.br/).\",\"market_slug\":\"will-renan-santos-win-the-2026-brazilian-presidential-election\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-10-04T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x966a3221e05d8d0579854c4952085331da2a42989dee0fa033d24cada9dfca00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0xabd4a891dfef7b744628b1a107a79b4fc00750fd923492c394874d47c380fc73\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-renan-santos-win-the-2026-brazilian-presidential-election-UU3ccbcu_OS6.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-renan-santos-win-the-2026-brazilian-presidential-election-UU3ccbcu_OS6.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":5}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"93998891488819623915454849994768171534113749478841216025646247933473925258016\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.057,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"7565921021555775006041943394390068423142281108752994121417017072842379450830\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.943,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Global Elections\",\"Brazil\",\"World Elections\",\"Macro Election 2\",\"World\",\"Rewards 200, 4.5, 50\",\"Main Election\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-07-11T21:05:04Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xc5eae79d1ffe716572353962eb926b1e3964c500a4880a7a94f58408218ee76b\",\"question_id\":\"0x7b95a46fc059d27ac3404325fd6280974d96949102201de57b8595f802d7fc03\",\"question\":\"2026 Balance of Power: R Senate, R House\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the result of the 2026 United States midterm elections.\\n\\nA party will be considered to have 'control' of the House of Representatives, if they win a majority of voting seats.\\n\\nA party will be considered to have 'control' of the Senate if they have more than half of the voting Senate members, or half of the voting Senate members and the Vice President.\\n\\nA candidate's party is determined by their ballot-listed or otherwise identifiable affiliation with that party at the time the 2026 United States midterm elections are conclusively called by this market's resolution sources. A candidate without a ballot-listed affiliation to either the Democrat or Republican Parties will be considered a member of one of these parties based on the party that they most recently expressed their intent to caucus with at the time the 2026 United States midterm elections are conclusively called by this market's resolution sources.\\n\\nIf control of the House is ambiguous given the above rules, this market will resolve according to the party affiliation of the first Speaker of the US House who is selected following the 2026 United States midterm elections. \\n\\nIf control of the Senate is ambiguous given the above rules, this market will resolve according to the party affiliation of the first Majority Leader of the US Senate who is selected following the 2026 United States midterm elections.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the Associated Press, Fox News, and NBC. This market will resolve once all three sources have conclusively called winners of the House and Senate in the 2026 United States midterm elections. If all three sources do not achieve consensus in calling the relevant races for this market, it will resolve based on the official certification.\",\"market_slug\":\"2026-balance-of-power-r-senate-r-house-537\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-11-03T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x7b95a46fc059d27ac3404325fd6280974d96949102201de57b8595f802d7fc00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x8e48e4a168ae49c01bd8f6ea399949ef8eaa25db2474ea006f339a341cfefb1e\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/balance-of-power-2024-election-r-Fp-y4ONJBS.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/balance-of-power-2024-election-r-Fp-y4ONJBS.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"103704141773947678931823410030956181918562062788486034785782641603149828893320\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.165,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"25869296386911654049715489068824757745174681288397238521780118949553760488529\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.835,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"United States\",\"US Election\",\"Global Elections\",\"Midterms\",\"Earn 4%\",\"Rewards 20, 4.5, 50\",\"Main Election\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-05T15:21:41Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xf67b35a73ee7b84b1427f0d1462ddcf8c3942201c91d9573f192ff19aaba7bbf\",\"question_id\":\"0xd019b70149cda09ee294e2475b609e5d72301fb29175c40e183f8650583ce100\",\"question\":\"Will Erin Stewart win the 2026 Connecticut Governor Republican primary election?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the winner of the Republican Primary for Governor of Connecticut, scheduled to take place on August 11, 2026. Resolution will be based on the overall winner of the primary, including any potential second round or run-off.\\n\\nIf no 2026 Connecticut Gubernatorial Republican Primary takes place, this market will resolve to “Other.”\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be the first official announcement of the results from the Connecticut Republican Party; however, an overwhelming consensus of credible reporting may suffice.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-erin-stewart-win-the-2026-connecticut-governor-republican-primary-election\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-08-11T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xd019b70149cda09ee294e2475b609e5d72301fb29175c40e183f8650583ce100\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x97924e05a3f40121fb013f815ead5fea2cb6fb8e750964231799292fe78335eb\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/connecticut-governor-republican-primary-winner-DDB-62fXI34k.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/connecticut-governor-republican-primary-winner-DDB-62fXI34k.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"a