rnor of California as indicated by a consensus of credible reporting. If there is ambiguity, this market will resolve based solely on the official results as reported by the government of California, specifically the Office of the Secretary of State.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-tony-thurmond-get-the-first-or-second-most-votes-in-the-2026-california-governor-primary-election\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-02T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/california-governor-election-2026-4b5HcLPNupez.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/california-governor-election-2026-4b5HcLPNupez.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"112611090356742606119885786437671053131136302178818105459453706074757269808726\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.0195,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"61538385557703547970309765325307411586460089124649546109762017098562888716699\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.9805,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-24T22:25:35Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x4752aea49cdba4bba51d0263e60748aae3a1548f89cfe3515b1f6d91a2ef0d10\",\"question_id\":\"0x3048018c0516944ca29709e567667b53ff857c709b4881207ab2f144cb45c991\",\"question\":\"Will UNI reach $14.00 by December 31, 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will immediately resolve to “Yes” if any Binance 1-minute candle for Uniswap (UNI/USDT) between November 24, 2025, 17:25 and December 31, 2026, 23:59 ET has a final “High” price equal to or greater than the price specified in the title. Otherwise, the market will resolve to “No.”\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is Binance, specifically the UNI/USDT “High” prices available at:\\nhttps://www.binance.com/en/trade/UNI_USDT\\nwith the chart set to “1m” (one-minute candles) on the top bar.\\n\\nOnly the Binance UNI/USDT price feed will be used.\\nPrices from other exchanges, trading pairs, or spot markets will not be considered.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-uni-reach-14pt00-by-december-31-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2027-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-uniswap-enable-a-protocol-fee-switch-by-december-31-FUkByQ9oMjEQ.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-uniswap-enable-a-protocol-fee-switch-by-december-31-FUkByQ9oMjEQ.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"104706297549834247346222993347634698849900525620728794474620669046979793481873\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.13,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"76036746727397513233020935483331675745006577504877561142608189336988425540001\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.87,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Crypto\",\"Crypto Prices\",\"uniswap\",\"Hit Price\",\"Monthly\",\"Yearly\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-04T23:19:47Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x50b747a9e8efa400cc053169e43347516b932aaf7b5