e BNB/USDT “High” prices available at: https://www.binance.com/en/trade/BNB_USDT with the chart set to “1m” (one-minute candles) on the top bar.\\n\\nPlease note that the outcome of this market depends solely on the price data from the Binance BNB/USDT trading pair. Prices from other exchanges, different trading pairs, or spot markets will not be considered for the resolution of this market.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-bnb-reach-1200-by-december-31-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2027-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/bnb-all-time-high-by-december-31-MRsmG1FSYuSN.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/bnb-all-time-high-by-december-31-MRsmG1FSYuSN.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791bca1f2de4661ed88a30c99a7a9449aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"71821109389263178606838921738260809635650614456731779176870942261511421965557\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.12,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"10487336370965574588984991505442044853278428794162158032244445576030453413279\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.88,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Crypto\",\"Crypto Prices\",\"Hit Price\",\"Yearly\",\"BNB\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-27T15:26:39Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x8f556c1a64b593796ea422693ff29a3ff768cede5e5991f7a46bb0ec59a2e7c0\",\"question_id\":\"0x5346923c615b845248a1275ace4d6ff9cd16b04a99269d490ffda89709d87f1b\",\"question\":\"Will Exponent launch a token by September 30, 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to “Yes” if Exponent (https://x.com/ExponentFinance) officially launches a governance token by 11:59 PM ET on the date specified in the title. Otherwise, this market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nThe token must be actively and publicly transferable and tradable. Announcements alone do not qualify.\\n\\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be information from Exponent, however a consensus of credible reporting will also be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-exponent-launch-a-token-by-september-30-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2027-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-exponent-launch-a-token-by-3tDGeRlwnkAP.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-exponent-launch-a-token-by-3tDGeRlwnkAP.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"7800402680270593380926829443314565490316076217237982552423562583216301083819\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.1965,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"274547691454701369310357935163763564334695186194934833301629654130407282759\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.8035,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Crypto\",\"token launch\",\"Pre-Market\",\"Exponent\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2026-01-02T18:54:29Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x1b0a4870cd50bdf9e9e5bc9f8ad42b011fadd554610f99699db34dca6d09fde1\",\"question_id\":\"0x7f48816e3243c697d83540865383f1533cc9aab21367697d710849e3e8a3060e\",\"question\":\"Will US unemployment reach at least 6.0% in 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to “Yes” if any seasonally adjusted unemployment rate (total unemployed, as a percent of the civilian labor force, official unemployment rate denoted as U-3) reported by the Bureau of Labor Statistics in an “Employment Situation Report” for a reference month in 2026 is greater than or equal to the listed percentage. Otherwise, this market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nThe relevant reports for this market are the Employment Situation Reports for January-December, 2026. This market may not resolve to “No” until the Employment Situation report for December 2026 is released. If no Employment Situation Report for December 2026 is released by March 31, 2027, 11:59 PM ET, however, this market will resolve based on all previously published data up to that time. \\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the Monthly Employment Situation Report, published by the BLS every month at https://www.bls.gov/bls/news-release/empsit.htm, specifically the U-3 measure in Table A-15 for each month.\\n\\nNote: the resolution source for this market reports unemployment to one decimal point. Thus, this is the level of precision that will be used when resolving the market.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-us-unemployment-reach-at-least-6pt0-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-01-10T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/march-unemployment-rate-wpcB-Q7lTi_r.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/march-unemployment-rate-wpcB-Q7lTi_r.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":3}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"10801