ial Democratic Primary takes place, this market will resolve to “Other.”\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be the first official announcement of the results from the Minnesota Democratic Party; however, an overwhelming consensus of credible reporting may suffice.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-amy-klobuchar-win-the-2026-minnesota-governor-democratic-primary-election\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-08-11T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x949722d7dfdf591360604925a797986762192dc1b701dc62bf10e9151ec10200\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0xbecb9fa6d6bc1f6d3602a07529f0a790544d387e862daa125475cd812898a318\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/minnesota-governor-republican-primary-winner-BpIlDlfqLVQ2.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/minnesota-governor-republican-primary-winner-BpIlDlfqLVQ2.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":3}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"29035787139244190083153658096265169704037063896635728582080036265166304907002\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.945,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"42559463187786502481877064131480540966616358793085706934737471791298425831544\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.055,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\",\"primary elections\",\"Democratic Primary\",\"Governor Primary\",\"Minnesota Primary\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-25T20:39:21Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xb6f26187d7459a50e69881a10ec6b08c4c0ec028ad026de8318378959aed6b50\",\"question_id\":\"0x54bd494037c713bbf852a8dc141ed173cb4a8e5b55cdd2d18f9766f2b95b3602\",\"question\":\"Will Joe Baldacci be the Democratic nominee for ME-02?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the candidate who wins the nomination for the Democratic Party to contest the ME-02 congressional district seat in the U.S. House of Representatives in the 2026 midterm elections. The Democratic primary will take place on June 9, 2026.\\n\\nIf no nominee is announced by November 3, 2026, 11:59PM ET, this market will resolve to \\\"Other\\\".\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be a consensus of official Democrat sources, including https://democrats.org/.\\n\\nAny replacement of the nominee before election day will not change the resolution of the market.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-joe-baldacci-be-the-democratic-nominee-for-me-02\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-09T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x54bd494037c713bbf852a8dc141ed173cb4a8e5b55cdd2d18f9766f2b95b3600\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0xb0d0e40920e530da64188bb088068882a270895531a6b12605cc71b3ba16016c\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/who-will-be-the-democratic-nominee-for-me-02-mBHUaFB_mMGH.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/who-will-be-the-democratic-nominee-for-me-02-mBHUaFB_mMGH.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":3}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"111931948682777013040422255478831628743617879288259818363734728457729334056322\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.615,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"80254527176049495694410967894469545801727038882182500988185682481095728400860\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.385,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\",\"primary elections\",\"Democratic Primary\",\"House Primary\",\"Maine Primary\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-16T15:24:29Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x41e7c27975bd53fe08a5ab30960934bfea92b60b88f56ee9d9b42b8b0c97d98d\",\"question_id\":\"0x5f1d121cdb1b6cd154e99b5effb2eda0947f4b37f7b26b8ba46c3e14404c89bd\",\"question\":\"Will David Sacks leave the Trump administration before 2027?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to “Yes” if it is announced that that the listed individual will leave the Trump Administration, or otherwise ceases to be a member of administration by December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nAn announcement of the listed individual's resignation/removal before this market's end date will immediately resolve this market to \\\"Yes\\\", regardless of when the announced resignation/removal goes into effect.\\n\\nThe Trump administration includes individuals formally appointed by Donald Trump to roles within the U.S. federal government, such as Cabinet members, Executive Office staff, senior policy advisors, ambassadors, or White House staff whose appointments are publicly announced by official government channels.\\n\\nThe primary resolution source will be official information from the Trump administration, however a consensus of credible reopening may also be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-david-sacks-leave-the-trump-administration-before-2027\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/who-will-leave-trump-administration-in-2025-I6Rk9u0UMDav.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/who-will-leave-trump-administration-in-2025-I6Rk9u0UMDav.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"53980309552254752656853888092299477403267897422429296395260794844350132560294\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.3555,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"45887092025298924217842696025355710279164363697398752699292545449535885700136\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.6445,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Trump\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-10-13T22:37:57Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xbf4144ee69c04fafaf23f455cee1e240cb4a643aec6276ef6159929a4a070280\",\"question_id\":\"0x5a57c20b2083c2dbc50b8fed1cf788313e38592f2f374ee415dc5f3ac192b800\",\"question\":\"Will the Democrats win the Idaho Senate race in 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the winner of the 2026 midterm Idaho U.S. Senate election, inclusive of any run-offs.\\n\\nA candidate shall be considered to represent a party in the event that he or she is the nominee of the party in question. Candidates other than the Democratic or Republican nominee (e.g., Greens, Libertarian, independent) may be added at a later date.\\n\\nCandidates who run as independents will not be encompassed by the “Democrat” or “Republican” options regardless of any affiliation they may have with the party.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the Associated Press, Fox News, and NBC. This market will resolve once all three sources call the race for the same candidate. If all three sources haven’t called the race in this state for the same candidate, this market will resolve based on the official certification.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-democrats-win-the-idaho-senate-race-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":null,\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x5a57c20b2083c2dbc50b8fed1cf788313e38592f2f374ee415dc5f3ac192b800\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0xde1021c6624e95dabd86be42cfef668c1ccc0ed1c6bd7113a1916f1ffe525155\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-democratic-party-control-the-senate-after-the-2026-midterm-elections-JJ9h02JGR09z.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-democratic-party-control-the-senate-after-the-2026-midterm-elections-JJ9h02JGR09z.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":100,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"106941193163110167696426338043140728938381127310653153528096347878604033727123\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.075,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"80934691869338927255837304938089888360426615780964561477823921040289407849741\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.925,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"US Election\",\"Midterms\",\"Idaho Midterm\",\"Senate midterms\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-18T20:48:35Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xec4dc95b761c2122d08ad01c6741be853d5cfab5987bb47229f27e1236c38745\",\"question_id\":\"0x40e3c1ad489652da5cde539ed6f4a6977fd2fad177e5815fedc15b80e578faae\",\"question\":\"Will Eric Vaughan advance to the general election for WA-03?\",\"description\":\"The non-partisan primary election for the WA-03 congressional district seat in the U.S. House of Representatives is scheduled to take place on August 4, 2026. The two candidates who receive the most votes in this primary election will qualify for the General Election.\\n\\nThis market will resolve to “Yes” If the listed candidate advances from the primary to the general election for the WA-03 congressional district seat in the U.S. House of Representatives. Otherwise this market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nIf no 2026 WA-03 congressional district primary takes place, this market will resolve to “No.”\\n\\nThis market will resolve based on the results of the primary election for the WA-03 congressional district seat, as indicated by a consensus of credible reporting. If there is ambiguity, this market will resolve based solely on the official results as reported by the government of Washington, specifically the Washington Office of the Secretary of State.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-eric-vaughan-advance-to-the-general-election-for-wa-03\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-08-04T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/wa-03-house-election-winner-yhLDeGZqATqe.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/wa-03-house-election-winner-yhLDeGZqATqe.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"92130961971401160313149111604343026651628615045260268558559738584081556997643\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.1,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"5278225328066280397742170395237333385118701353654119687681744602979566690537\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.9,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\",\"primary elections\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-16T21:17:11Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0xba01b6ad2f090ea29936617f0209ad7f97ad73dd61bfc100632a61618f856801\",\"question_id\":\"0xc404a641beccc4d216954c428dd77eb1d64a16d41239c7820481ef5734ddac00\",\"question\":\"Will the Prosperity Party (Prosperity) win the most seats in the 2026 Ethiopian general election?\",\"description\":\"General elections are scheduled to be held in Ethiopia on June 1, 2026.\\n\\nThis market will resolve according to the political party that wins the greatest number of seats in the next Ethiopian House of Peoples' Representatives election. \\n\\nIf the results are not known definitively by December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET, this market will resolve to \\\"Other\\\".\\n\\nIn the event of a tie between multiple parties for the most seats won, this market will resolve in favor of the party or coalition that received a greater number of valid votes. In the event that results in a tie, this market will resolve in favor of the party or coalition whose listed abbreviation appears first in alphabetical order.\\n\\nThis market's resolution will be based solely on the number of seats won by the named party in the Ethiopian Parliament.\\n\\nThis market will resolve based on the results of this election as indicated by a consensus of credible reporting. If there is ambiguity, this market will resolve based solely on the official results as reported by the Ethiopian government, specifically the National Election Board of Ethiopia (NEBE) (nebe.org.et/en).\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-prosperity-party-prosperity-win-the-most-seats-in-the-2026-ethiopian-general-election\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-01T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xc404a641beccc4d216954c428dd77eb1d64a16d41239c78204