\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x4e43ba407ed4bd1346f959cde78c4ba9c8bb80595a03757c34a0c650e99fde00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x2c878236d5e35c9b5c74dcb9354fec54432c9ed37a88b71270ab6f7e9b5e28dc\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-democratic-party-control-the-senate-after-the-2026-midterm-elections-JJ9h02JGR09z.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-democratic-party-control-the-senate-after-the-2026-midterm-elections-JJ9h02JGR09z.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"47540146623620182724372695903724852067595146419459482790641441152489267651664\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.76,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"9425494630420524762356091484606706289169789796333686976670441967109493832767\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.24,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"US Election\",\"Midterms\",\"Wisconsin Midterm\",\"Governor midterms\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2026-01-04T19:54:15Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x83df756ae0573207e64790bae996c605553bb0831f8d1ff60823b71b63c09822\",\"question_id\":\"0x9ee853a03624ef84d9b24290bd05ad9ab973540b621ec0598abc2d751379f203\",\"question\":\"Will Sean Strickland be the UFC Middleweight Champion on December 31, 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the official UFC Middleweight division champion on December 31, 2026 at 12:00 PM ET.\\n\\nOnly official UFC division champions will count. Interim champions will not count.\\n\\nIf the relevant belt is vacant at this market’s check time, or there is otherwise no champion in the specified division, this market will resolve to “Other”.\\n\\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be official information from the UFC (https://www.ufc.com/athletes).\",\"market_slug\":\"will-sean-strickland-be-the-ufc-middleweight-champion-on-december-31-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0x9ee853a03624ef84d9b24290bd05ad9ab973540b621ec0598abc2d751379f200\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x8480402ed7f635f4c045c8129320ee271a46b0dc264785b17675867abc320f65\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/who-will-become-a-ufc-champion-in-2026-VWze2qWnAGJc.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/who-will-become-a-ufc-champion-in-2026-VWze2qWnAGJc.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":0.001}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"20378600951485464849672966369201654683307593621002954347556085141663626930283\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.1445,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"14265907721103675502202673752569855273494951495706289755096181793879117144873\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.8555,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Sports\",\"UFC\",\"mma\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-11-05T17:51:55Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x5db999fad322cea2914535aae5517060c3f80ad6d8c0231cde2124a434d16846\",\"question_id\":\"0x132f882f851badfe460732d16fa20309910759adc990d9073e9f77ad6387d7c2\",\"question\":\"Will the U.S. invade Iran before 2027?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve to \\\"Yes\\\" if the United States commences a military offensive intended to establish control over any portion of Iran by December 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to \\\"No\\\".\\n\\nFor the purposes of this market, land de facto controlled by Iran or the United States as of November 4, 2025 12:00 PM ET, will be considered the sovereign territory of that country.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be a consensus of credible sources.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-us-invade-iran-before-2027\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-12-31T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":0,\"taker_base_fee\":0,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-us-invade-iran-in-2025-0Eh3J0ku_Fbj.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/will-the-us-invade-iran-in-2025-0Eh3J0ku_Fbj.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":2000}],\"min_size\":200,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"55115078421062885512539156303747803058407616201213034911037320915726138659123\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.265,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"1910830010387565971650098373488592514702818137344973088263643820608151819241\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.735,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Iran\",\"Trump\",\"Middle East\",\"Israel\",\"Geopolitics\",\"World\",\"Military Strikes\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-04T23:19:39Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x6655be0c676ac0b1b87cee226a4bb6c115a7086071689c4d71af81f65b94d45e\",\"question_id\":\"0xa4366184a2bd5ae97d7f69a1185a09670f47d6755d7ef509656ec4d96b44462c\",\"question\":\"Will Kyle Langford advance from the 2026 California Governor primary election?\",\"description\":\"The non-partisan primary election for Governor of California is scheduled to take place on June 2, 2026. The top two candidates in this election by number of votes won will advance to the general election for Governor of California.\\n\\nThis market will resolve to “Yes” If the listed candidate advances from the primary to the general election for Governor of California. Otherwise this market will resolve to “No”.\\n\\nIf no 2026 California gubernatorial primary takes place by December 31, 2026, this market will resolve to “No.”\\n\\nThis market will resolve based on the results of the primary election for Governor of California as indicated by a consensus of credible reporting. If there is ambiguity, this market will resolve based solely on the official results as reported by the government of California, specifically the Office of the Secretary of State.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-kyle-langford-get-the-first-or-second-most-votes-in-the-2026-california-governor-primary-election\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-02T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/california-governor-election-2026-4b5HcLPNupez.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/california-governor-election-2026-4b5HcLPNupez.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"65277858918244990962742138751510192216020918323934114409690398795164619657512\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.0255,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"59607147065949355942153006684915468633828482128167750322912669468364332169637\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.9745,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-02T20:41:27Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x61c4f9b8b29569661a926fbbf35d8fd9c29f4a49c7d9652e63e8c36635af7e90\",\"question_id\":\"0xb3e82292eb105c174721cd9d20db0b658ebf8da8dd1f9d956f6f8577881d9d00\",\"question\":\"Will John E. Sununu be the Republican nominee for Senate in New Hampshire?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the winner of the Republican Primary for United States Senator from New Hampshire.\\n\\nIf no 2026 New Hampshire Republican Senate Primary takes place, this market will resolve to \\\"Other\\\".\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market will be the first announcement of the results from the New Hampshire Republican party, however an overwhelming consensus of credible reporting may suffice.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-john-e-sununu-be-the-republican-nominee-for-senate-in-new-hampshire\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-09-08T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xb3e82292eb105c174721cd9d20db0b658ebf8da8dd1f9d956f6f8577881d9d00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0x81f1457c561dae5999bbc59abeb0acbb2dbe89003373f43c03c30f4d0daa4291\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/new-hampshire-republican-senate-primary-winner-296-m3jFpF8O1RBZ.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/new-hampshire-republican-senate-primary-winner-296-m3jFpF8O1RBZ.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":3}],\"min_size\":50,\"max_spread\":4.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"69839203014050310738285770489487399607824935783258097124985135350965237238801\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.88,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"78684292002727412280960119371072804219753908421001332059115826618167775955498\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.12,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\",\"primary elections\",\"Republican Primary\",\"New Hampshire Primary\",\"Senate Primary\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-12-26T23:33:09Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.001,\"condition_id\":\"0x5b87791e06388b1a91fd402c29e483842da0f9fec156bb3cefe9d58275a0373b\",\"question_id\":\"0xfa1a950e066a0976c643a285a8ce6b8eb2957f88bccdb395fb9185e3e2436e01\",\"question\":\"Will Gold (GC) settle at $3,800-$4,200 in June?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the official CME settlement price for the Active Month of Gold futures on the final trading day of June 2026.\\n\\nIf the reported value falls exactly between two brackets, then this market will resolve to the higher range bracket.\\n\\nIf the final trading day of the month is shortened (for example, due to a market-holiday schedule), the official settlement price published for that shortened session will still be used for resolution. If no settlement price is published for that session, the market will use the most recent published settlement for the Active Month during June.\\n\\nFor CME Gold (GC) futures contracts, the Active Month is the nearest of CME's designated delivery-cycle months (February, April, June, August, October, December) that is not the spot month. The Active Month changes automatically on the contract's First Position Date, at which point the next eligible contract month becomes the Active Month.\\n\\nOnly the Active Month's official settlement price published by CME Group will be considered. Intraday trades, highs, lows, bids, offers, midpoint values, or indicative prices do not count.\\n\\nNote that the settlement price may differ from the last traded price. CME's methodology to determine the settlement price can vary by commodity and contract.\\n\\nOnly days during June on which CME publishes an official settlement price for the Active Month will be included. Days without settlement prices (weekends, holidays, or market closures) are ignored.\\n\\nThis market will resolve based on the settlement price as it appears on the CME settlement page at the time it is first published for the relevant trading day, regardless of any later corrections or updates.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the CME Group website — specifically, the daily \\\"Settlement\\\" price for the Active Month of Gold (GC) futures.\",\"market_slug\":\"gc-settle-3800-4200-jun-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-30T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xfa1a950e066a0976c643a285a8ce6b8eb2957f88bccdb395fb9185e3e2436e00\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"0xff5acd2d127aba0e70a030eb6acff4a9daf8ad68b3037ddee03c6766029327b0\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/gold-logo-0d00c80498.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/gold-logo-0d00c80498.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":3}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"90132986654259086678529082268082617450254793801662820786849470352289449813683\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.1505,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"88022913747451311038559242580697856881859219751804674115271835179181575694176\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.8495,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Finance\",\"Commodities\",\"Gold\",\"Hide From New