ction for Governor of California as indicated by a consensus of credible reporting. If there is ambiguity, this market will resolve based solely on the official results as reported by the government of California, specifically the Office of the Secretary of State.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-derek-grasty-get-the-first-or-second-most-votes-in-the-2026-california-governor-primary-election\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-06-02T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/california-governor-election-2026-4b5HcLPNupez.png\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/california-governor-election-2026-4b5HcLPNupez.png\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":1}],\"min_size\":20,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"43560051549783951152143834143820873785622409287122852625062801925913859423564\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.0165,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"29653653148080757348800258330275760242097591849561379229506998290425252865822\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.9835,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"Primaries\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-10-24T19:48:40Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0x9345d5142a67f5541264c96515496affee02580f1c572680759eac9fd2a1588a\",\"question_id\":\"0x229292383b22e842da01e7e8f2853e0c2193791b88a0305f9239183635d263f8\",\"question\":\"Billionaire one-time wealth tax passes in California election 2026?\",\"description\":\"A one-time wealth tax on billionaires has been proposed to potentially appear on California's ballot for the November 3, 2026 general election. You can read more about that here: https://6abc.com/post/california-union-proposes-taxing-billionaires-offset-medicaid-cuts-low-income-people/18066430/\\n\\nThis market will resolve to \\\"Yes\\\" if any proposition containing a one-time tax targeting individuals, households, or family units with wealth, assets, or net worth of at least $1 billion (USD or equivalent) passes in the named election. Otherwise, this market will resolve to \\\"No\\\".\\n\\nIf no qualifying ballot initiative is certified to appear on the official statewide California ballot as a proposition to be voted on in the stated election by June 25, 2026, 11:59 PM ET (the official cutoff date for new initiatives to be approved), or if all qualifying propositions/initiatives are removed from the ballot or amended before the election such that the main threshold drops below $1 billion, this market will resolve \\\"No\\\".\\n\\nThe primary resolution source for this market will be official information from the Government of the State of California, however a consensus of credible reporting may also be used.\",\"market_slug\":\"billionaire-one-time-wealth-tax-passes-in-california-election-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":\"2026-11-03T00:00:00Z\",\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":false,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"\",\"neg_risk_request_id\":\"\",\"icon\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/billionaire-one-time-wealth-tax-on-california-ballot-Cu7EZFeYeO2R.jpg\",\"image\":\"https://polymarket-upload.s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/billionaire-one-time-wealth-tax-on-california-ballot-Cu7EZFeYeO2R.jpg\",\"rewards\":{\"rates\":[{\"asset_address\":\"0x2791Bca1f2de4661ED88A30C99A7a9449Aa84174\",\"rewards_daily_rate\":50}],\"min_size\":200,\"max_spread\":3.5},\"is_50_50_outcome\":false,\"tokens\":[{\"token_id\":\"38487155026041533062980821872238023790862908049855818921747904019478875496931\",\"outcome\":\"Yes\",\"price\":0.435,\"winner\":false},{\"token_id\":\"7330556727383706468662351173040823924339817877848787483691015397124505109410\",\"outcome\":\"No\",\"price\":0.565,\"winner\":false}],\"tags\":[\"Politics\",\"Elections\",\"referendum\",\"Taxes\",\"referendums midterms\"]},{\"enable_order_book\":true,\"active\":true,\"closed\":false,\"archived\":false,\"accepting_orders\":true,\"accepting_order_timestamp\":\"2025-10-13T22:38:25Z\",\"minimum_order_size\":5,\"minimum_tick_size\":0.01,\"condition_id\":\"0xffc0030fa887b259b313f7a695e34ce8776fdf1b674d1d7812f0e31782c3aca0\",\"question_id\":\"0xaa5fe3ff53bbfb3378f988a850e010175465f8ad717bdaf151dffbbf826b6200\",\"question\":\"Will the Democrats win the Alabama Senate race in 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market will resolve according to the winner of the 2026 midterm Alabama U.S. Senate election, inclusive of any run-offs.\\n\\nA candidate shall be considered to represent a party in the event that he or she is the nominee of the party in question. Candidates other than the Democratic or Republican nominee (e.g., Greens, Libertarian, independent) may be added at a later date.\\n\\nCandidates who run as independents will not be encompassed by the “Democrat” or “Republican” options regardless of any affiliation they may have with the party.\\n\\nThe resolution source for this market is the Associated Press, Fox News, and NBC. This market will resolve once all three sources call the race for the same candidate. If all three sources haven’t called the race in this state for the same candidate, this market will resolve based on the official certification.\",\"market_slug\":\"will-the-democrats-win-the-alabama-senate-race-in-2026\",\"end_date_iso\":null,\"game_start_time\":null,\"seconds_delay\":0,\"fpmm\":\"\",\"maker_base_fee\":1000,\"taker_base_fee\":1000,\"notifications_enabled\":true,\"neg_risk\":true,\"neg_risk_market_id\":\"0xaa5fe3ff53bbfb3378f98